msgid "Class"
msgstr "类别"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:24 9c0cfaa827c3494ab68b826547346d8c
msgid "What it means and what it costs"
msgstr "含义与代价"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:25 82aa7496d9b34bb68c78d6086e01df12
msgid "**F**"
msgstr "**F**"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:26 34668b19f29f444ba663e98327408eb9
msgid ""
"The library was wrong: a computation, a contract, a constant that does "
"not exist. These earn unbounded effort, because a wrong foundation "
"multiplies -- every capability built on it inherits the error and the "
"evidence for it."
msgstr "库错了：某处计算、某个契约、某个根本不存在的常数。这类问题值得不计成本地投入，因为错误的地基会成倍放大——建立在它之上的每项能力都继承了这个错误，以及支撑它的那些证据。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:28 670132b0aa834b94b8cd4c870c97ed71
msgid "**C**"
msgstr "**C**"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:29 cdc0806c4e8149d284d6b6b83631c287
msgid ""
"The criterion was wrong: it did not bind to the physics it claimed to "
"test, or the tolerance was chosen after seeing the number. Fixing this is"
" re-deriving the tolerance and writing down where it came from, which is "
"slower than widening it."
msgstr "判据错了：它没有绑定到自己声称要检验的物理量，或者容差是在看到数字之后才选的。修这种错是重新推导容差并写下它的出处，这比放宽容差更慢。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:32 40757cb5c8dd43e3aab42d320560e210
msgid "**A**"
msgstr "**A**"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:33 17709e113d11454987a54f8012ca772d
msgid ""
"The analysis was wrong: the measurement was fine and the reading was not."
" The fix is to the method, never to the code -- patching code because a "
"reading was misread damages a foundation that had nothing wrong with it."
msgstr "分析错了：测量没问题，读法有问题。要修的是方法，绝不是代码——因为一次读错就去改代码，会损伤一个本来毫无问题的地基。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:36 4639f185756542e7962d79e9d1cb12d7
msgid ""
"The distinction is the whole point. Treat an **A** as an **F** and the "
"library collects defensive patches it does not need; treat an **F** as an"
" **A** and a real defect is recorded as a personal slip and left in "
"place."
msgstr ""
"区分本身就是重点。把 **A** 当成 **F** ，库里就会堆起并不需要的防御性补丁；把 **F** 当成 **A** "
"，真实缺陷就被记作一次个人失误，留在原地。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:40 8f9be6afc4ab4e20b86280558ed15c74
msgid "How the blast-radius column is produced"
msgstr "影响范围列的产生方式"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:42 cef1a4d3ff0e4b498eeb0e0782cf102c
msgid "Not by memory, and not by reading the diff and guessing. The command is"
msgstr "不靠记忆，也不靠读 diff 去猜。命令是"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:48 55bfdb6ad0264e01a4090989bd0087f6
msgid ""
"which reads the basis graph in `.github/project/claim-basis.json` and "
"prints every claim that rests on that thing, together with the cases to "
"re-run. `evidence` in the README answers \"what checks this claim\"; "
"`basis` answers \"what would invalidate it\", and the two are different "
"-- a claim can have evidence that passes while resting on a plant model "
"that is wrong, which is the W7-c failure exactly."
msgstr ""
"该命令读取 `.github/project/claim-basis.json` "
"里的依据图，打印出所有以该对象为依据的主张，以及需要重跑的用例。README 里的 `evidence` 回答“什么在检查这条主张”； "
"`basis` 回答“什么会让它作废”，两者并不相同——一条主张可以有全部通过的证据，同时压在一个错误的被控对象模型上，W7-c 的失败正是如此。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:53 909f0989ec074b2a998ccef4c0900539
msgid ""
"Twelve of the forty-one claim rows had a basis when the graph was first "
"built; the other twenty-nine were listed explicitly as unmapped and the "
"gate printed that count on every run. It is now complete -- 51 of 51 "
"installed headers are mapped -- and the count is still printed, because "
"the mechanism that filled it is the same one that has to keep it full: a "
"row in neither list fails the build, and a new header arrives with either"
" a basis or a stated reason it has none."
msgstr ""
"依据图初建时，四十一条主张行里有十二条带着依据；其余二十九条被显式列为未映射，门禁每次运行都打印这个计数。现在它已补全——51 个已安装头文件中的"
" "
"51个全部映射——计数仍在打印，因为把表填满的机制，就是必须让它保持填满的那个机制：既不在有依据列表、也不在未映射列表的行会让构建失败，新头文件到来时必须带着依据，或者带着一句它为什么没有依据的说明。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:58 f6c8e21a9b334e2b895df9bd5cbe8ad1
msgid ""
"The graph is generated from the code rather than from recollection. An "
"edge is either a compile edge (a `foc/` header the module or its own "
"`.cpp` includes directly) or a semantic one (another module whose value "
"the claim quotes without including it -- `core/pi.hpp`'s claim quotes "
"numbers that `motor/motor_config.hpp` computes, and if that formula moves"
" the claim is stale while every test still passes). Six headers are roots"
" with no incoming edge and carry a self-edge; the asymmetry is stated "
"rather than smoothed over."
msgstr ""
"依据图从代码生成，而不是凭回忆画出来。一条边要么是编译边（模块或其自身的 `.cpp` 直接包含的某个 `foc/` "
"头文件），要么是语义边（另一个模块——主张引用了它算出的值却没有包含它： `core/pi.hpp` 的主张引用了 "
"`motor/motor_config.hpp` "
"计算出的数字，那个公式一挪，主张就过期了，而所有测试仍然通过）。六个头文件是根，没有入边，只带一条自环；这处不对称照实写出，没有抹平。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:64 5affca5882cd42ce9d74160848c2fdf7
msgid ""
"The graph is also checked for rot: a basis entry naming a file that no "
"longer exists, or an identifier that appears nowhere in `include/` or "
"`src/`, fails the build, because a decayed graph returns a confident and "
"wrong blast radius and that is worse than returning nothing. It caught "
"two while being filled -- `src/core/protection.hpp`, which is a header, "
"and three entries that resolved to nothing."
msgstr ""
"依据图还查腐坏：某条依据指向一个已不存在的文件，或指向一个在 `include/` 、 `src/` "
"里都找不到的标识符，构建就会失败，因为一张腐坏的图会返回一个自信而错误的影响范围，那比什么都不返回更糟。填图过程中它抓到两处—— "
"`src/core/protection.hpp` ，那其实是个头文件，以及三条解析不到任何东西的条目。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:69 ba9b357dd11142d9abf373cb16693222
msgid ""
"One answer worth knowing before the next wave: **156 of the 169 claims "
"rest on `core/types.hpp`**. That is not a surprise, and it is the reason "
"a change to the value layer is not a small change no matter how "
"mechanical it looks."
msgstr ""
"下一波之前值得知道的一个答案： **169 条主张中有 156 条压在 `core/types.hpp` 上** "
"。这不意外，也正是为什么对取值层的改动无论看起来多机械，都不是小改动。"

