#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:95 593f8fe6e4584e469d196257a032e245
msgid ""
"The SIL bench called `reset()` before every step, which threw away the "
"intra-period high-frequency content -- the injection carrier. The "
"observer was being handed a frozen carrier and reported it as a "
"measurement."
msgstr ""
"SIL 台架在每一步之前都调用 `reset()` "
"，把周期内的高频成分——注入载波——丢掉了。观测器拿到的是一个冻结的载波，却把它当作测量报了出来。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:97 fd556855e3a646dcba75c1176a346b37
msgid ""
"The envelope bench produced three mutually inconsistent readings in a row"
" (a speed-PI artefact, a pi-mirror lock, a degenerate standstill) and "
"each was explained by a different cause. The real cause was one line in "
"the harness; the fix was `set_mechanical_speed()`, which writes the rotor"
" state without resetting."
msgstr ""
"包络台架连续给出三个互相矛盾的读数（一处速度 PI 伪迹、一次 pi "
"镜像锁死、一次退化到零速），每一个都被不同的原因解释过。真正的原因只是台架里的一行；修法是 `set_mechanical_speed()` "
"，它写转子状态而不复位。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:100 37471fe1eb1e40a9839cda5d8b740112
msgid "The entire low-speed envelope table. Everything in it was re-measured."
msgstr "整张低速包络表。表中每一项都重新测过。"

