#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:174 981b79aee2584cf0be40152c21a667b9
msgid "A-5"
msgstr "A-5"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:176 f987e6ceb83c4bbf8664d877231232ff
msgid ""
"The scaling invariant was stated as \"the electrical parameters scale\": "
"`Rs`, `Ld`, `Lq`, `kt` and `v_bus` were multiplied by `k` while `J` and "
"`B` were left alone. Torque then scaled and inertia did not, so the speed"
" the RK4 stages carry *within* a period stopped being proportional, and "
"the back-EMF term with it."
msgstr ""
"缩放不变式被表述为“电气参数一起缩放”： `Rs` 、 `Ld` 、 `Lq` 、 `kt` 、 `v_bus` 乘以 `k` ，而 `J` 与 "
"`B` 原封不动。于是转矩缩放了，惯量没有，RK4各级在一个周期 *内部* 携带的转速不再成比例，反电动势项亦然。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:179 76c95950914c4c54bcdd6ce528367f2e
msgid ""
"The invariant itself: the trajectories differed by up to 3.2e-3 A at `k ="
" 25`, growing with `k`. Scaling `J` and `B` too collapsed the residual to"
" float resolution. The symmetry is not \"the electrical parameters "
"scale\", it is \"everything with a dimension scales\"."
msgstr ""
"不变式本身：在 `k = 25` 处轨迹最多相差 3.2e-3 A，且随 `k` 增大。把 `J` 与 `B` 也一起缩放，残差塌缩到 float"
" 分辨率。这个对称性不是“电气参数一起缩放”，而是“凡有量纲的一起缩放”。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:182 130d8ee33f8243dba3a6de372048dc70
msgid ""
"None -- found before the case was committed, and the criterion was "
"corrected rather than widened."
msgstr "无——在用例提交前就发现了，判据被更正而不是放宽。"

