msgid "A-6"
msgstr "A-6"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:186 3a58ca732bdf479fb680fbff6533b111
msgid ""
"Two counter-examples of mine were never actually exercised, so they "
"\"passed\" while proving nothing: one compared only the settled current "
"(an integrator absorbs a gain error completely by steady state; the "
"measured difference was 4.8e-7, indistinguishable from exact), and one "
"swept the input up to the clamp limit but never past it, so the branch it"
" was meant to catch never fired."
msgstr ""
"我的两个反例从未真正被执行过，于是它们“通过”了，却什么也没证明：一个只比较稳态电流（积分器在稳态会把增益误差完全吸收；实测差值 "
"4.8e-7，与精确值无法区分），另一个把输入扫到钳位上限为止、却从未越过它，于是它本该抓住的那个分支从未执行。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:190 87dbbb3f6e3f4c82b2272da6a527bb08
msgid ""
"Writing the counter-example down and asking what it would look like if it"
" failed. Both were fixed by moving the comparison into the transient "
"(periods 1, 5 and 25) and by letting the sweep cross the limit."
msgstr "靠把反例写下来，并追问它失败时会是什么样子。两处都改好了：把比较移进暂态（第 1、5、25 个周期），并让扫描越过上限。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:192 2f525c2764454450bf464f5056b1868e
msgid ""
"None. But the lesson is load-bearing: a control that is never exercised "
"looks exactly like a control that passes."
msgstr "无。但这条教训是承重的：一个从未被触发过的控制，看起来和一个通过的控制一模一样。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:194 25660e5883ab4c25a94288e95434a713
msgid "F-5"
