"before the assertion noticed."
msgstr ""
"我在头文件注释里、以及在钉住它大小的那个用例里，把轨迹记录写成 32 字节。它是 36：四字节时间戳、 **七个** "
"float、两字节状态。错数来自在一份七个的列表里数成六个 float，而它已经抄进了两个文件，断言才发现。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:219 6ac5bfd026ea4b3eafa7b7b99e71998c
msgid ""
"The assertion itself, `EXPECT_EQ(sizeof(TraceSample), 32U)`, which "
"reported 36 on its first run. Nothing else would have: a struct that is "
"four bytes larger than documented changes how many periods fit in 2 KiB, "
"and no other case cares."
msgstr ""
"断言本身， `EXPECT_EQ(sizeof(TraceSample), 32U)` ，第一次运行就报 "
"36。别的什么都不会发现：一个比文档大四字节的结构，改变的是 2 KiB 装得下多少个周期，而其他用例都不关心这个。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:222 9d5cd81212724bc9b1ca999f792c6703
msgid ""
"Two comments and one test constant. Which is the point of pinning a size "
"at all -- the claim \"2 KiB holds N periods\" is now arithmetic nobody "
"has to remember."
msgstr "两处注释和一个测试常量。这正是钉住大小的意义——“2 KiB 装 N 个周期”现在是一道算术，不需要任何人去记。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:226 e3839e761de145789903f9f447d26690
msgid "F-6"
msgstr "F-6"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:228 b282525c34e048a382e50851c11f7f30
msgid ""
"`foc_bridge_get_setup` copied seventeen fields of the setup and silently "
"dropped the six that had been appended to `foc_motor_setup_t` over three "
"waves: `observer`, `inject_v`, `inject_hz`, `blend_start_rad_s`, "
"`blend_end_rad_s`, `handover_lpf_hz`. `Motor.setup()` -- the first place "
"a support engineer looks -- therefore reported the *defaults* for exactly"
" the fields that choose the observer, while `status()[\"observer\"]` "
"reported the truth from the live object."
msgstr ""
"`foc_bridge_get_setup` 复制了 setup 的十七个字段，却静默丢掉了三波里追加到 `foc_motor_setup_t` "
"上的六个： `observer` 、 `inject_v` 、 `inject_hz` 、 `blend_start_rad_s` 、 "
"`blend_end_rad_s` 、 `handover_lpf_hz` 。于是 `Motor.setup()` "
"——支持工程师第一个看的地方——报告的恰恰是选择观测器那几个字段的 *默认值* ，而 `status()[\"observer\"]` "
"报告的是活对象里的真相。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:233 45f48a43055e43d7bd93cf5449aa1703
msgid ""
"Building the first golden window: the readback said `observer=BACK_EMF, "
"inject_v=0` while `status()` said `HFI` for the same motor. No test "
"caught it because every readback case asserted only pre-append fields -- "
"the test asked whether the fields it knew about came back, never whether "
"the struct came back."
msgstr ""
"构建第一个黄金窗口时：回读说 `observer=BACK_EMF, inject_v=0` ，而同一台电机的 `status()` 说 "
"`HFI` 。没有测试抓到，因为每个回读用例只断言追加之前的字段——测试问的是它知道的那些字段有没有回来，从来没问整个结构有没有回来。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:236 7a71c65398a44053a7cf31300ad8daaf
msgid ""
"One function, plus a case that sets every field and demands all of them "
"back, so the next appended field is caught in the same place it is added."
msgstr "一个函数，外加一个用例：设置每个字段并要求全部回来，这样下一个被追加的字段，会在它被加进去的同一个地方被抓到。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:239 71a446836fa8483698f56e81a7c65848
msgid "F-7"
msgstr "F-7"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:241 67ba9e9486664b20b059e14cce76e74a
msgid ""
"Selecting the injection observer through `Motor` applied **no carrier at "
"all**, on any axis whose HAL supplies an angle. `tick()` took the sensor "
"branch, so the observer was never stepped; an observer that is never "
"stepped never advances its carrier phase, and a carrier frozen at phase 0"
" sits at a zero crossing, so `injection_ab()` returned exactly 0.0 V. The"
" mode was admitted, reported as ``HFI`` by `status()`, and inert -- every"
" surface agreed with the caller except the inverter. The C host path "
"always supplies an angle (`read_angle_mech_rad` is required by the HAL "
"contract), so this was the whole Python face, not an edge case."
msgstr ""
"通过 `Motor` 选择注入观测器时，在任何由 HAL 提供角度的轴上， **完全没有施加载波** 。 `tick()` "
"走了传感器分支，于是观测器从未被推进；从不被推进的观测器不会推转载波相位，而冻结在相位 0 的载波停在零穿越点上，于是 "
"`injection_ab()` 返回恰好 0.0 V。这个模式被接纳，被 `status()` 报成 ``HFI`` "
"，却是惰性的——除逆变器之外，每个接口面都同意调用方的说法。C 宿主路径总是提供角度（HAL 契约要求 `read_angle_mech_rad`"
" ），所以这是整个 Python使用面，不是边界情况。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:247 d1ebe53887874d8a85c22c0c487f60b9
msgid ""
"Trying to record a golden window for the injection path: the duty swing "
"over 3000 periods was 0.00000 while `status()[\"observer\"]` said `HFI`. "
"Instrumentation, not inference, then narrowed it: the "
"`SwitchableObserver` standalone injects ±9.56 V (so the slot forwards), "
"the composed `HfiObserver::update` **never printed** (so it was never "
"called), and `injection_ab()` read 0 because `phase_applied_` had never "
"moved. No existing case caught it because every ABI case asserted "
"admission and the reported mode, and the W7-c SIL work drove "
"`HfiObserver` directly -- the composed path was covered by nothing."
msgstr ""
"想为注入路径录一个黄金窗口时：3000 个周期内占空比摆幅是 0.00000，而 `status()[\"observer\"]` 说 `HFI`"
" 。靠插桩而不是靠推理，才把它收窄：单独使用的 `SwitchableObserver` 注入 ±9.56 V（说明槽位是通的），组合后的 "
"`HfiObserver::update` **从未打印** （说明它从未被调用）， `injection_ab()` 读到 0，因为 "
"`phase_applied_` 从未移动。没有既有用例抓到它，因为每个ABI用例只断言接纳和报告的模式，而 W7-c 的 SIL 工作直接驱动 "
"`HfiObserver` ——组合出来的路径无人覆盖。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:253 d7d4765a5e654318b55efd76785255ef
msgid ""
"Two gates in `tick()`, plus one case that asserts the carrier reaches the"
" inverter on a sensored axis and one that keeps asserting it on a "
"sensorless one. The observer is now stepped whenever it injects "
"(``speed_from_observer || injecting_now()``), and the carrier is added on"
" the same condition. The sensor keeps the commutation angle and the "
"published speed, so an encoder rig gets a hybrid drive rather than losing"
" its angle to a carrier."
msgstr ""
"`tick()` 里两道门，外加一个断言载波在有传感轴上到达逆变器的用例，和一个在无感轴上继续断言它的用例。现在只要在注入就推进观测器（ "
"``speed_from_observer || injecting_now()`` "
"），载波按同一条件叠加。传感器保留换相角与发布转速，于是带编码器的台架得到的是一种混合驱动，而不是让载波夺走它的角度。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:259 116b5b50936243e185746da4d83bebf6
msgid "F-7a"
msgstr "F-7a"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:261 49b05580b9114760bbaaed2ad5fb3c1b
msgid ""
"The first fix attempt widened the carrier gate alone "
"(``speed_from_observer || injecting_now()``) and the case passed -- which"
" proved nothing, because the observer's phase starts at 0 and the "
"injection was zero either way. Reverting the fix left the case green: an "
"unfalsifiable test standing in for a fixed defect."
msgstr ""
"第一次修复只放宽了载波门（ ``speed_from_observer || injecting_now()`` "
"），用例通过了——而这什么也没证明，因为观测器相位从 0 "
"开始，注入在两种情况下都是零。把修复还原后用例仍然是绿的：一个不可证伪的测试，替一个已修的缺陷站了岗。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:264 60ffdb3102f14612a0b02936be20de29
msgid ""
"Reverting the fix and re-running it. The criterion has to be able to go "
"red; the way to know is to make it."
msgstr "靠把修复还原再跑一遍。判据必须有可能变红；知道的办法就是让它变红。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:265 f4e4b6941ddb44de9a4df87c6bd7f37a
msgid ""
"The second attempt. Then the two halves were shown to be independently "
"load-bearing: reverting the *step* gate alone (carrier gate left open) "
"gives a swing of 0.0000, and reverting the *carrier* gate alone gives "
"0.0000 as well. Both were needed, and neither was detectable from the "
"diff."
msgstr ""
"第二次尝试。随后两半被证明各自独立承重：只还原 *推进* 门（载波门保持打开），摆幅 0.0000；只还原 *载波* 门，同样是 "
"0.0000。两者都必要，而任何一者都无法从 diff 里看出来。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:269 27ebeb8ae21b465f87b57040d810e6bb
msgid "F-7b"
msgstr "F-7b"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:271 459bb32282c14cf7b8bb5ec25881dcd9
msgid ""
"The second fix attempt refused the mode at `init()` when the observer "
"type could inject -- using ``has_injection_v<Observer>``, which is a "
"property of the **type**, not of the selected mode. Every motor whose "
"observer could switch modes was refused, and 38 cases went red. Narrowing"
" the probe to ``injecting()`` (the mode) brought it to 6, still the wrong"
" answer: the refusal was treating an inert carrier as correct by refusing"
" to run."
msgstr ""
"第二次修复尝试在 `init()` 里拒绝这个模式：只要观测器类型可能注入就拒绝——用的是 "
"``has_injection_v<Observer>`` ，那是 **类型** "
"的属性，不是所选模式的属性。凡是观测器能切换模式的电机都被拒绝，38 个用例变红。把探针收窄到 ``injecting()`` （模式）后降到 6"
" 个，仍是错的答案：这种拒绝是在以“不跑”把惰性载波当作正确。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:275 7dfb944f52c846fb8d823ff96c8d558a
msgid ""
"The test suite itself, in the same run. The trait answered \"can this "
"type ever inject\", the question was \"is this mode injecting now\", and "
"only the test count separated the two."
msgstr "测试套件本身，同一次运行里。那个 trait 回答的是“这个类型是否可能注入”，而问题是“这个模式现在是否在注入”，只有用例数量把两者分开了。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:277 e1d28803441e467ea8d72581d4b1f23a
msgid ""
"The refusal, removed. A mode that is admitted must run; refusing "
"admission is how a defect becomes a documented limitation."
msgstr "拒绝逻辑被移除。被接纳的模式就必须运行；以拒绝接纳收场，正是缺陷变成“已记录的限制”的方式。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:280 b65a1718c525435e9dcfd3b30a0e5630
msgid "A-9"
msgstr "A-9"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:282 e41d71b2416e46e492745f579bb784df
msgid ""
"The probe that first measured F-7 ran with `pwm_freq_hz = 0` in the "
"setup, which drives the carrier phase increment to zero on its own. The "
"0.00000 it reported was therefore guaranteed before the defect was "
"consulted -- and the same rig, after the fix, still read 0.00000 at 6 kHz"
" and would have looked like a failed fix."
msgstr ""
"最初测 F-7 的那个探针，setup 里 `pwm_freq_hz = 0` ，这本身就使载波相位增量为零。它报出的 0.00000 "
"因此在缺陷被查问之前就已注定——而同一台架在修复之后，6 kHz 下仍读到 0.00000，看上去会像一次失败的修复。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:285 171652ad44eb43589c9de2ceb6c146e5
msgid ""
"Sweeping the carrier rate against an explicit `pwm_freq_hz`: the same "
"code, one knob changed, went from 0.00000 at 1/2/4/5 kHz to "
"0.60/0.65/0.66/0.67. A probe is only worth its reading once it has been "
"shown able to produce a non-zero one."
msgstr ""
"对着显式的 `pwm_freq_hz` 扫载波频率：同一份代码，只改一个旋钮，从1/2/4/5 kHz 下的 0.00000 变为 "
"0.60/0.65/0.66/0.67。一个探针只有在被证明能产出非零读数之后，它的读数才值钱。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:288 6943b57b70df42c5a79c53945fd63f57
msgid ""
"The F-7 verdict, re-measured. Pre-fix 0.00000 at all four rates with "
"`observer = HFI`; post-fix 0.45-0.67 across eight rate/PWM combinations. "
"Same window, one knob, both directions."
msgstr ""
"F-7 的结论，重新测量。修复前在四个频率下都是 0.00000（ `observer = HFI` ）；修复后在八种频率/PWM 组合下为 "
"0.45-0.67。同一个窗口，一个旋钮，两个方向。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:292 bde178d367454d509ded0fbae28bbeff
msgid "F-8"
msgstr "F-8"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:294 5587b3744e154f669c238362cf4d9f2d
msgid ""
"`benchmark/script/foc_sil_plant.py` added the **mechanical** acceleration"
" `torque / j` to `omega_e`, which is an **electrical** speed, and then "
"divided by the pole-pair count when reporting mechanical speed. Every "
"mechanical transient in the Python plant was therefore `pole_pairs` times"
" too slow -- measured **7.002x** at seven pole pairs on an open-loop "
"acceleration test against `T / J`."
msgstr ""
"`benchmark/script/foc_sil_plant.py` 把 **机械** 加速度 `torque / j` 加到 "
"`omega_e` 上，而后者是 **电气** 转速，然后在报告机械转速时又除以极对数。于是 Python 被控对象里的每个机械暂态都慢了 "
"`pole_pairs` 倍——在七对极、开环加速、对照 `T / J` 的测试里实测 **7.002 倍** 。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:298 f78adf2e444f4e7c99ad35c58e0a678e
msgid ""
"The analysis layer's analytic criterion, on its first run. The fitted "
"bandwidth of a speed step on the Python face read **17.78 rad/s against "
"the 250 rad/s the setup asked for**. Varying one knob at a time separated"
" the suspects: the fitted bandwidth scaled exactly as `1 / kt` and "
"exactly as `j`, which is the gain law behaving correctly on a plant that "
"was too slow to respond, not a gain law that was wrong. A two-line open-"
"loop test then produced the number 7.002."
msgstr ""
"分析层的解析判据，第一次运行。Python 使用面上一次速度阶跃的拟合带宽读到 **17.78 rad/s，而 setup 要求 250 "
"rad/s** 。逐个改一个旋钮把嫌疑人分开：拟合带宽精确地随 `1 / kt` 缩放，也精确地随 `j` "
"缩放，这说明增益律在一台慢到无法响应的被控对象上是正确的，而不是增益律错了。随后两行的开环测试给出了 7.002 这个数。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:303 b1e2b3fa98fe4cb2925facaca5981e25
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Every mechanical quantity ever derived from that plant. The golden "
"ledger's `speed_step_100` settled in 0.2 s (the whole window) and now "
"settles in 0.0211 s; its \"overshoot\" was a 5.6 % *undershoot* of a loop"
" still crawling, and is now +0.005 %. The three windows were re-recorded,"
" and every figure that had been quoted from them replaced."
msgstr ""
"凡是从那台被控对象导出的机械量。黄金台账的 `speed_step_100` 在 0.2 s（整个窗口）才稳定，现在 0.0211 s "
"稳定；它的“超调”其实是一个还在爬行的环路5.6 % 的 *下冲* ，现在是 +0.005 %。三个窗口重新录制，凡是从中引用过的数字全部替换。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:308 3c40408b37934474826b4008955c39de
msgid "F-9"
msgstr "F-9"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:310 167d4a03be5049839ac8d69b14ef6c99
msgid ""
"The same plant integrated a fixed 50 us (`DT`) per `write_duty` call, "
"while `golden.py` ticks at 100 us. The model advanced half a period per "
"call, so simulated time ran at **half speed** -- an exact factor of two "
"on top of F-8's seven."
msgstr ""
"同一台被控对象每次 `write_duty` 调用都积分固定的 50 us（ `DT` ），而 `golden.py` 以 100 us "
"步进。模型每次调用只前进半个周期，于是仿真时间以 **一半的速度** 流逝——在 F-8 的七倍之上，又精确地乘以二。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:313 2d7ed6a3cb7b41afbe93005edc7d1d2a
msgid ""
"Reading the constant after F-8's factor of seven did not explain the "
"whole 14x: 250/7 = 35.7, and the measurement said 17.8. `grep DT` found "
"`50e-6` against the caller's `1e-4`."
msgstr ""
"在解释掉 F-8 的七倍之后再去读那个常数，仍解释不了全部 14 倍：250/7 =35.7，而测量说的是 17.8。 `grep DT` 找到 "
"`50e-6` ，而调用方用的是 `1e-4` 。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:315 af1650dc1b6d4edd98884e777a94f32f
msgid ""
"The plant now takes `dt_s`, `golden.py` carries one `DT_S` that both the "
"loop and the plant use, and the two development scripts that already "
"ticked at 50 us are unaffected. Together F-8 and F-9 account for 14.05x, "
"and the corrected measurement is 243.57 rad/s against 250 (-2.57 %)."
msgstr ""
"被控对象现在接收 `dt_s` ， `golden.py` 携带一个 `DT_S` ，环路和被控对象共用它，两个本来就以 50 us "
"步进的开发脚本不受影响。F-8 与 F-9 合起来解释了14.05 倍，更正后的测量值是 243.57 rad/s，对照 250（-2.57 "
"%）。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:319 197b9ec6dec94abc9650a7fea9ad5844
msgid "A-10"
msgstr "A-10"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:321 ca2cfb102fb146afb8a846cb34f64115
msgid ""
"The ledger could not have found either defect, and it was not asked to: "
"it compares the Python plant against a recording *of the same Python "
"plant*. A self-referential baseline detects regressions and is silent "
"about initial errors, however long it is stared at."
msgstr ""
"台账不可能发现这两个缺陷中的任何一个，也没有被要求去发现：它拿 Python 被控对象与 *同一台 Python 被控对象* "
"的录制结果相比。自指的基线能发现回归，对初始错误却一言不发，盯多久都一样。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:324 915d15e6cc3e4aac925aada652256fa3
msgid ""
"The analysis layer's second opinion -- the gain law's analytic bandwidth "
"on one side, the C++ bench's independent plant on the other. Neither "
"shares a line of model code with the Python plant, and the disagreement "
"was 14x."
msgstr ""
"分析层的第二意见——一边是增益律的解析带宽，另一边是 C++ 台架独立的被控对象。两者与 Python 被控对象不共用一行模型代码，而分歧是 14"
" 倍。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:326 88fae35140b945ae8129fb5f3182bc00
msgid ""
"The reason 1.3 was worth doing before more scenarios were added: a ledger"
" with one implementation can only say \"unchanged\", and \"unchanged\" is"
" how a wrong model becomes a specification."
msgstr "这就是在增加更多场景之前值得先做 1.3 的原因：只有一份实现的台账只能说“没变”，而“没变”正是错误模型变成规格说明的途径。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:330 7e4671dc13ab41baab1ffa81b94d0ee3
msgid "A-11"
msgstr "A-11"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:332 ad44149e5eef463e9670f9d115661bf1
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The absolute 10 % criterion was written into the plan, met at 9.15 %, and"
" looked like a passing gate. Scaling the speed loop's proportional gain "
"by 0.8 -- a 20 % error in the gain law the criterion exists to check -- "
"moved the reading to 225.31 rad/s, i.e. **-9.88 %, still inside the "
"band**. The estimator's own +9.15 % bias was the same size as the defect."
msgstr ""
"10 % 的绝对判据写进了计划，以 9.15 % 达标，看起来像一道通过的门禁。把速度环比例增益乘以 0.8——这是判据本该检查的增益律上 20 "
"% 的误差——读数变成225.31 rad/s，即 **-9.88 %，仍在带内** 。估计器自己 +9.15 % 的偏置，与这个缺陷一样大。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:336 ef06479c299745bebb15ee27ffc6168d
msgid ""
"Perturbing the thing the criterion is about, rather than trusting it "
"because it went green. A tolerance met by an estimator whose bias is "
"comparable to the effect has almost no discriminating power, and no "
"amount of reading the tolerance reveals that -- you have to break the "
"system and watch."
msgstr "靠扰动判据所针对的那个东西，而不是因为它变绿就相信它。当估计器的偏置与被测效应相当，它“达标”的容差几乎没有分辨力，而这件事读多少遍容差都看不出来——必须弄坏系统，然后看。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:339 54ed719031a7449e9b88242622050ca8
msgid ""
"A second criterion that cannot be hidden by the bias: request 125 and 250"
" rad/s and demand the measurements move by the same factor (measured "
"134.66 and 272.87 rad/s, ratio 2.026). It catches a loop that ignores the"
" request, not a scale error -- the frequency sweep that catches scale "
"errors is the next increment, and this row is why it is the next "
"increment."
msgstr ""
"第二条不会被偏置掩盖的判据：分别请求 125 与 250 rad/s，要求测量值按同一倍数变化（实测 134.66 与 272.87 "
"rad/s，比值 2.026）。它抓的是无视请求的环路，抓不到尺度误差——抓尺度误差的扫频是下一个增量，而这一行就是它成为下一个增量的原因。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:345 e6ead150a11246a286b88dfae76b623c
msgid "A-12"
msgstr "A-12"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:347 1eccf77398af4148b6c3569c11a26aba
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The first version of the sweep found the -3 dB crossing by interpolating "
"in log-log space between 0.5 and 2 times the bandwidth, and reported "
"**180 rad/s for a loop whose answer is 235** -- a 28 % error, made "
"entirely of interpolation. Interpolating a first-order magnitude between "
"two points that far apart is not a straight line: reduced per point (wb ="
" w / sqrt(1/g^2 - 1)) the same four measurements give 236.4, 235.8, 236.4"
" and 238.3."
msgstr ""
"第一版扫频通过在 0.5 到 2 倍带宽之间、双对数空间里插值来求 -3 dB 穿越点，为一个答案为 235 的环路报了 **180 "
"rad/s** ——28 % 的误差，全部来自插值。在相距那么远的两个点之间插值一阶幅值，并不是一条直线：把同样的四个测点逐个归算（wb = w "
"/ sqrt(1/g^2 - 1)），得到 236.4、235.8、236.4 和 238.3。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:351 05193179e0c34f488d88d52a9ae3ee6f
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Reducing every measured point individually instead of trusting the "
"interpolant. The four values agreeing to 1 % is what proved the loop is "
"first-order at the Python face and the error was the arithmetic between "
"the points."
msgstr "靠把每个测点各自归算，而不是相信插值。四个值一致到 1 %，这才证明环路在Python 使用面是一阶的，误差出在点与点之间的算术上。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:353 fdb61d0baa0e42719eb6cdb756ff8b01
msgid ""
"The -3 dB definition: the sweep now bisects, which assumes nothing about "
"shape. The C++ bench turns out *not* to be first-order (its per-point "
"equivalents fall 269.5 to 188.8), which the interpolation had been "
"hiding."
msgstr ""
"-3 dB 的定义方式：扫频改成二分，这对曲线形状不作任何假设。C++ 台架其实 *不是* 一阶的（它的逐点等效值从 269.5 掉到 "
"188.8），而这一点一直被插值掩盖着。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:356 94aa3e4889544128adbd5a2d43c34887
msgid "A-11b"
msgstr "A-11b"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:358 dacc371bc83a44908c9e0b9e02a247f0
msgid ""
"A-11 said the frequency sweep would catch what the absolute step band "
"cannot, and left it as a claim about a future instrument. It is now "
"measured on the same defect: scaling the speed loop's proportional gain "
"by 0.8 moves the sweep's crossing from 234.91 to **210.79 rad/s (-15.68 "
"%, outside the 10 % band)** while the step fit moves from +9.15 % to "
"-9.88 %, still inside its own. Same defect, two instruments, one blind "
"and one not."
msgstr ""
"A-11 说扫频能抓住阶跃绝对带抓不到的东西，那时它只是一条关于将来仪器的断言。现在它在同一个缺陷上测过了：把速度环比例增益乘以 "
"0.8，扫频的穿越点从234.91 移到 **210.79 rad/s（-15.68 %，落在 10 % 带外）** ，而阶跃拟合从+9.15 %"
" 变到 -9.88 %，仍在自己的带内。同一个缺陷，两件仪器，一个瞎，一个不瞎。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:362 aee5ab24fc1a410fbec02c6146b84fe6
msgid ""
"Running both criteria against the same perturbation, which is the only "
"way to know which one is carrying the claim."
msgstr "让两条判据面对同一次扰动，这是唯一能知道哪一条在承载主张的办法。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:364 73536397996c4e4f98301882ee9c7ae7
msgid ""
"The sweep is now the criterion that carries it; the step response stays "
"because it says something different (how the servo behaves, not where its"
" corner is)."
msgstr "现在承载它的是扫频判据；阶跃响应保留，因为它说的是另一件事（伺服表现如何，而不是它的拐点在哪里）。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:368 499e4744b91842158f373a2a674b014b
msgid "A-13"
msgstr "A-13"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:370 559fcbf58e2a48319a2b62c0e6a212b4
msgid ""
"The first Monte-Carlo criterion -- \"with `sigma = 0` the harness must "
"reproduce the nominal measurement bit for bit\" -- called one trial twice"
" and compared the two. It was green, and it could not fail: it never went"
" through the sampler, so the bug it exists to catch (a sampler that "
"perturbs by a hair when asked not to) was invisible to it. Drifting the "
"sampler to add 0.001 to sigma left the case green."
msgstr ""
"第一条 Monte-Carlo 判据——“ `sigma = 0` "
"时台架必须逐位复现标称测量”——把同一次试验跑两遍再比较。它是绿的，而且不可能失败：它从未经过采样器，于是它存在的意义所要抓的那个缺陷（一个在被要求不扰动时仍扰动一丝的采样器）对它不可见。把采样器漂移到让"
" sigma 多加 0.001，用例仍然是绿的。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:374 0dcd6c1e32d34601970aa805eaa3f9d8
msgid ""
"Drifting every criterion and watching which ones stay green. Three of the"
" four drifted cases went red; this one did not, which is how the hole was"
" found."
msgstr "靠把每条判据都漂移一次，看哪些仍然是绿的。四个漂移用例里三个变红；这一个没有，洞就是这样找到的。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:376 5ef00b853614437c9a8b94093d301c8b
msgid ""
"The criterion now runs the *stream*, so `draw()` is in the path: the same"
" 0.001 drift produces 244.4909 against 244.4273 and the case fails. Third"
" instance of one family -- A-6 (\"a control that is never exercised\"), "
"A-11 (\"a band the defect fits inside\"), A-13 (\"a criterion that "
"bypasses the code it is about\"). The common cause is that a green test "
"is evidence of nothing until it has been made to go red."
msgstr ""
"判据现在跑的是 *数据流* ， `draw()` 就在路径上：同样的 0.001 漂移给出244.4909 对 "
"244.4273，用例失败。同一族的第三例——A-6（“从未被触发的控制”）、A-11（“缺陷装得进去的带”）、A-13（“绕开自身所指代码的判据”）。共同的成因是：一个测试在被迫变红之前，绿的什么也证明不了。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:382 73c79112e56a4343847fb8a69fd6022b
msgid "A-14"
msgstr "A-14"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:384 b7d6a85120784018a13413d2d56ef38a
msgid ""
"The first version of the torque map's arithmetic case asserted that a "
"positive `id` *raises* the torque on an `ld < lq` machine. It lowers it: "
"the reluctance term is `1.5*pp*(ld-lq)*id*iq`, so the sign follows `ld - "
"lq` and the usual interior machine has `ld < lq`. The map was right and "
"the case was wrong."
msgstr ""
"转矩映射的算术用例，第一版断言：在 `ld < lq` 的电机上，正的 `id` 会 *抬高* 转矩。它实际是降低：磁阻项为 `1.5*pp"
"*(ld-lq)*id*iq` ，符号随 `ld -lq` ，而通常的内嵌式电机是 `ld < lq` 。映射是对的，用例错了。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:387 c85bb2cd2b4a4afa82994768e4d690c3
msgid ""
"The case failing against arithmetic that was already correct, and the "
"analytic expression it was comparing with. Nothing in the map had to "
"change."
msgstr "用例对着本来就正确的算术失败了，还有它拿来比较的解析表达式。映射里什么都不用改。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:389 a2abc94e201741bb805317390c0e8958
msgid ""
"Two assertions, and one more reason the case states the expression "
"instead of quoting a number: a quoted number would have been edited to "
"match the wrong sign."
msgstr "两条断言，以及用例宁可写出表达式、也不引一个数字的又一个理由：引来的数字会被改成配合错误符号。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:393 6c5ccdb82fd74e04a7773ebb17efc60f
msgid "C-4"
msgstr "C-4"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:395 69e875993b3f4c57a2e495e983b37e82
msgid ""
"The graded protection ladder had a case for the derating curve "
"(`derated_limit(T)`, a pure function) and a case for the trip, and "
"nothing in between: no case ever stepped the protector with a temperature"
" *inside* the band, and no case anywhere asserted `active_mask`, so the "
"enum-order ranking the header documents was unexercised too."
msgstr ""
"分级保护阶梯有降额曲线的用例（ `derated_limit(T)` ，一个纯函数），也有跳闸的用例，中间什么也没有：没有任何用例把温度放在带 "
"*内部* 去步进保护器，也没有任何地方断言 `active_mask` ，于是头文件记录的枚举顺序排序同样未被触发。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:398 fabf2221f1424b57b0c6894d9ef3956f
msgid ""
"Writing the two cases the plan's own criterion named -- \"each rung has a"
" case, and an implementation that trips without derating must be red\" --"
" and then building exactly that wrong implementation: replacing "
"`t_trip_c` with `t_derate_start_c` in the over-temperature condition left"
" **seven of eight** protection cases green. Only the new ladder case "
"failed."
msgstr ""
"照着计划自己的判据写出那两条用例——“每一级都有用例，而一个只跳闸不降额的实现必须变红”——然后真的做出那个错误实现：把过温条件里的 "
"`t_trip_c` 换成 `t_derate_start_c` ， **八个保护用例中有七个** 仍然是绿的。只有新的阶梯用例失败。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:402 fb0b4c4cf3cc45c39afc3170a1c252f8
msgid ""
"Two cases, and the `todo` in the capability matrix's boundary column that"
" had been standing in for them is now a case name. The rule this row is "
"about: a capability with a curve test and a trip test can still have no "
"test of the thing it is for."
msgstr ""
"两条用例，以及能力矩阵边界列里那个一直替它们占位的 `todo` "
"，现在是一个用例名。这一行讲的规则是：一项能力有了曲线测试和跳闸测试，仍然可能对它服务的那个目的毫无测试。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:407 b1fffdd1fe674bb99633105096125ff3
msgid "A-15"
msgstr "A-15"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:409 d8384b7c60404e3e898e3840c3d52837
msgid ""
"Building the stiction rig I wrote a \"current source\" that nulled `diq` "
"**at the current the plant happened to have**. That is a free integrator,"
" not a source: it holds the current wherever the transient left it. The "
"case's own arithmetic caught it twice -- 37.85 rad/s against a promised "
"40.00 with the d current drifting, then 35.49 with the d current pinned, "
"because `iq` had settled at 0.90988 A against a 1.0 A setpoint."
msgstr ""
"搭建静摩擦台架时，我写了一个“电流源”，它在 **被控对象恰好具有的电流上** 把 `diq` "
"置零。那是自由积分器，不是源：暂态把它丢在哪里，它就把电流持在哪里。用例自己的算术两次抓到它——d 轴电流漂着时是 37.85 "
"rad/s，对承诺的40.00；把 d 轴电流钉住后是 35.49，因为 `iq` 稳定在 0.90988 A，而设定值是1.0A。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:413 a90cd58aeac949158ef19b5357482917
msgid ""
"Printing what the plant actually ended with (`id 0.00700 iq 0.90988`) "
"instead of reasoning about the voltage. Two fixes were guesses at the "
"voltage; the third read the state and the answer was in the current."
msgstr ""
"靠打印被控对象实际停在的状态（ `id 0.00700 iq 0.90988` "
"），而不是对电压做推理。前两次修复是在电压上猜；第三次读了状态，答案在电流里。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:415 fd4a905dc7d14655b8e37359197bd1b8
msgid ""
"The source now feeds the **setpoints** with the d-q cross-coupling: "
"steady speed 39.997 against 40.000, `iq` 1.00000, torque 0.050000. The "
"lesson: regulating a derivative is not regulating a value, and a case "
"whose arithmetic is exact will say so."
msgstr ""
"现在这个源按 d-q 交叉耦合供给 **设定值** ：稳态转速 39.997 对 40.000， `iq` 1.00000，转矩 "
"0.050000。教训：调一个导数不等于调一个值，而算术精确的用例会把这件事说出来。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:420 04275968613f42a4932f4773c5e8b041
msgid "C-5"
msgstr "C-5"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:422 e2ba8e4bb96d46e39e213277b468976e
msgid ""
"The first version of the breakaway case could not tell \"it started\" "
"from \"it is still being held\": the plant's stiction band was 0.5 rad/s "
"and the sequence's release threshold was also 0.5 rad/s, so the two "
"thresholds described the same speed and \"last torque at rest\" and "
"\"first torque moving\" printed the same number. Separately the handover "
"value carried 5.4 ms of ramp -- 2.7 mN*m -- because the rotor has to "
"accelerate to the release speed, which was larger than the quantity the "
"case was checking."
msgstr ""
"起转用例的第一版分不清“它起步了”和“它还被困着”：被控对象的静摩擦带宽是0.5 rad/s，而序列的释放阈值也是 0.5 "
"rad/s，两个阈值描述同一个转速，“静止时最后一个转矩”与“运动时第一个转矩”打印出同一个数。另外，交接值里含着5.4 ms 的斜坡——2.7 "
"mN*m——因为转子必须先加速到释放转速，而这个量比用例要检查的量还大。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:427 e1e9bd3d404e4106930fc71558797b45
msgid ""
"Printing both numbers and noticing they were identical, then asking what "
"each threshold means: the band is a numerical necessity at the zero "
"crossing, the release speed is a physical claim about motion. They must "
"differ by a decade, and the handover's lag must be stated rather than "
"absorbed by the tolerance."
msgstr "把两个数都打印出来，发现它们完全相同，然后追问每个阈值是什么意思：带是过零处的数值必需品，释放转速是关于运动的物理主张。两者必须差一个数量级，而交接的滞后必须写出来，不能被容差吸收掉。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:430 92177d17fbd84122bc47dfcae981abc5
msgid ""
"The case now separates them (band 0.01, release 0.05 for the plant run) "
"and states the observation lag instead of hiding it: 1 mN*m of slack, "
"measured at 0.5 mN*m."
msgstr ""
"用例现在把它们分开（带 0.01，被控对象运行时的释放阈值 0.05），并把观测滞后写出来而不是藏起来：写明的余量是 1 mN *m，实测 0.5"
" mN* m。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:434 dab51e77476949ddaa3fe63b49b72a9d
msgid "A-16"
msgstr "A-16"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:436 bec2c4a81c8a413da7ff2e2b568bc1ec
msgid ""
"Editing the plan I located the 3.2 row with `line.startswith('| 3.2 |')`."
" That pattern also matched the **ROI audit table's** own `| 3.2 | 1.00 | "
"1.50 | 低估 |` row, which sits two hundred lines earlier, so the two new "
"rows landed inside the audit table and the real 3.2 row in the Phase 3 "
"table was never touched. The script printed \"3.2 closed\" and I believed"
" it; the plan still said the work was undone, and the user found it, not "
"me."
msgstr ""
"改计划时，我用 `line.startswith('| 3.2 |')` 定位 3.2 那一行。这个模式同时匹配上了 **ROI 审计表** "
"自己的 `| 3.2 | 1.00 | 1.50 | 低估 |` 行，那一行在两百行之前，于是两条新行落进了审计表，而 Phase 3 表里真正的"
" 3.2 行从未被碰到。脚本打印了“3.2 已关闭”，我信了它；计划里仍写着这项工作未做，而发现它的是用户，不是我。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:440 ddd5dc0356644e0ba3995896f8490b7e
msgid ""
"Reading the artifact back instead of the tool's own success message. "
"`grep '^| 3.2'` on the finished file would have shown two rows in one "
"place and none in the other."
msgstr "靠回读产物，而不是读工具自己的成功消息。对完成后的文件执行 `grep '^| 3.2'` ，就会看到一个地方有两行、另一个地方一行也没有。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:442 d96987d3cc174a01bc1dd2a793545464
msgid ""
"The two rows moved to where they belong, the audit table's row restored, "
"and the plan now states the ordering policy it was silently applying. The"
" rule: **a tool's \"done\" is a claim about the tool, not about the "
"file** -- the same shape as A-4 (did not look before starting) and A-13 "
"(a criterion that bypassed its own subject), and the same fix: look at "
"the artifact."
msgstr ""
"两条行移到该在的位置，审计表的那一行恢复，计划现在写明它此前一直在默默执行的排序策略。规则： "
"**工具的“完成”是关于工具的断言，不是关于文件的断言** ——与 A-4（动手前没看）和 "
"A-13（绕开自身对象的判据）同形，修法也相同：去看产物。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:448 357c9b7427374ffc81b4741b07c94240
msgid "C-6"
msgstr "C-6"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:450 4a8512732d7c4232867c48349fac1848
msgid ""
"The criterion for \"a dead Hall sensor\" was written as \"somewhere two "
"bits change at once (6 -> 4), which is the trace of the missing sensor\"."
" Measurement says otherwise: the dead bit is **frozen**, so every "
"surviving transition still flips exactly one bit and the code walk "
"degenerates onto a smaller Gray cycle instead of breaking the rule. The "
"criterion would have gone red on a *correct* model, and the natural "
"repair for a red case is to change the model -- which would have broken a"
" model that was right."
msgstr ""
"“霍尔传感器坏一个”的判据被写成“某处会同时有两位变化（6 -> 4），那就是缺失传感器的痕迹”。测量说的相反：坏掉的那一位是 **冻结的** "
"，于是每个幸存跳变仍然只翻一位，码的走法退化成更小的格雷码环，而不是违反规则。这条判据会在一个 *正确* "
"的模型上变红，而红用例的自然修法是改模型——那会把一个本来正确的模型弄坏。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:455 a47fb4b5b9d6456c9242ff33302851ca
msgid ""
"Measuring the model in a throwaway script before the first compile: the "
"flip counts for the stuck case read `[1,1,1,1]`, not `[1,2,...]`. "
"Reasoning would have kept the wrong signature, because \"a sensor is "
"missing so more than one thing must be wrong\" is a plausible-sounding "
"sentence."
msgstr ""
"在第一次编译之前，用一个临时脚本先测模型：卡死情形的翻转计数读到 `[1,1,1,1]` ，而不是 `[1,2,...]` "
"。靠推理会保留错误的特征，因为“少了一个传感器，所以坏掉的东西不止一处”是一句听起来很合理的说法。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:458 96de37637b8a4eb0aa503e5e3326d479
msgid ""
"The criterion, replaced by three facts measured instead: one 60-degree "
"illegal window per revolution (one sixth of the time), runs of 120 "
"degrees (the edge interval doubles), and three distinct legal codes left."
" Plus the assertion that adjacency **survives** -- the useful negative "
"result, since it says an adjacency check cannot be the fault detector."
msgstr ""
"判据换成三条测出来的事实：每转一个 60 度的非法窗口（占六分之一的时间）、成段 120 度（边沿间隔翻倍）、剩下三个不同的合法码。外加断言相邻性"
" **仍然成立** ——这就是那个有用的否定结果，因为它说明相邻性检查不能充当故障检测器。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:463 55d8dafd363b436d8ca5dcae093d11dd
msgid "C-7"
msgstr "C-7"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:465 600517ae52f74d93aefa8c880dd90a2a
msgid ""
"The quantisation case assumed the sector layout instead of reading it: it"
" took `theta = 0..60 deg` to be one sector. Sensors at 0/120/240 degrees "
"put their edges at 30/90/150/..., so **no** sector begins at zero; the "
"case straddled an edge and found two codes 59.96 degrees apart, then "
"reported it as a model error."
msgstr ""
"量化用例假定了扇区布局，而不是去读它：它把 `theta = 0..60 deg` 当成一个扇区。位于 0/120/240 度的传感器把边沿放在 "
"30/90/150/...，于是 **没有** 扇区从零开始；用例跨过一条边沿，找到两个相距 59.96 度的码，然后把它报成模型错误。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:468 02d79190c69f4cd3b3aa3eef37d2751c
msgid ""
"The case went red only after the sweep bug (A-17) was fixed; before that "
"every case failed on the count and the layout assumption stayed hidden "
"behind it."
msgstr "这个用例只有在扫频缺陷（A-17）修好之后才变红；在那之前每个用例都在计数上失败，布局假设一直藏在后面。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:470 4fb90e0023a949f0ac63b145a7007307
msgid ""
"The sector is now taken out of the sweep (the widest measured run), so "
"the case tests the sensor and not the arrangement. A model whose edges "
"are somewhere else now passes it, which is the point."
msgstr "扇区现在从扫频结果里取出（最宽的那个实测连续段），于是用例测的是传感器，不是排布。边沿在别处的模型现在也能通过它，这正是重点。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:473 5bbf714057344c8392ed0a76b3f48f8f
msgid "A-17"
msgstr "A-17"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:475 8b917c10dd0d4dbc90a2588ef3fe6b66
msgid ""
"The sweep that measures the sectors ran **two** revolutions: it computed "
"`samples = (2.0F * kTwoPiRad) / kStep`, and `kTwoPiRad` is already 2*pi, "
"so every count in the file was double six edge crossings instead of six, "
"twelve sectors instead of six, and a wrap-merge that had nothing to do."
msgstr ""
"测扇区的扫频跑了 **两** 圈：它计算 `samples = (2.0F * kTwoPiRad) / kStep` ，而 "
"`kTwoPiRad` 本身就是 "
"2*pi，于是文件里每个计数都成了两倍——本来六次的边沿穿越成了十二次，六个扇区成了十二个，还有一次无事可做的回绕合并。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:478 dc9e69fd56fc449a89dc337d2265a40a
msgid ""
"The very first assertion: `runs.size()` read 12 against an expected 6. "
"Five of the six cases in the file failed at once, and the sixth (no "
"illegal code anywhere) passed -- which localised it to the counting "
"rather than to the model, since the illegal-code sweep does not depend on"
" where the revolution ends."
msgstr ""
"第一条断言： `runs.size()` 读到 12，期望 "
"6。文件里六个用例有五个同时失败，第六个（任何地方都没有非法码）通过——这就把它定位到计数而不是模型，因为非法码扫描不依赖这一圈在哪里结束。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:481 c7803a3fa4c14b82ac438625b24b48cd
msgid ""
"One factor removed. The lesson recorded here is why the count was written"
" as an absolute number: a `>= 6` would have been satisfied by twelve and "
"the whole file would have read double forever."
msgstr "去掉一个因子。这里记下的教训是为什么计数要写成绝对值： `>= 6` 会被十二满足，整个文件就会永远读到双倍。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:484 0b38f43fa42244538f9b49269f08bac9
msgid "F-10"
msgstr "F-10"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:486 bb39aadf76194803bc5a80354a4a7832
msgid ""
"`HallTracker` stored the first sample's timestamp as if it were an edge. "
"The rotor can be anywhere inside a sector when the first sample is taken,"
" so the interval from that sample to the first real edge is short by an "
"unknown amount -- and it became the reference every later interval was "
"judged against."
msgstr ""
"`HallTracker` "
"把第一个采样的时间戳当作一个边沿存了下来。取第一个采样时，转子可能位于一个扇区内的任何位置，于是从那个采样到第一个真实边沿的间隔短了未知的一段——而它却成了此后每个间隔据以判定的基准。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:489 c1bc7c55a85e486da660f463690fa38c
msgid ""
"A perfectly healthy sensor set reported `State` on its second sector: 23 "
"samples of a 1280-sample run at 120 rad/s. The case that found it was the"
" one asserting `stale_fraction == 0` on a healthy run, which is the "
"negative half of the fault criterion and the only reason the startup path"
" was exercised at all."
msgstr ""
"一组完全健康的传感器在第二个扇区就报了 `State` ：120 rad/s 下，1280 个采样的一轮里有 23 "
"个。发现它的用例正是在健康运行中断言 `stale_fraction ==0` 的那个，它是故障判据的否定那一半，也是启动路径唯一被走到的原因。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:492 9d6cb25597064b17b1a065c08289d173
msgid "Intervals count only when both of their ends were edges."
msgstr "只有两端都是边沿的间隔才计入。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:494 646772d3f9584559be77e3eb4d5b05f2
msgid "F-11"
msgstr "F-11"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:496 3ab9193e25b94ed9a82dc90d580b1e02
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The reference period was updated from any interval that arrived, "
"including one that was evidence of a fault. Two instances, opposite "
"directions: a **doubled** interval adopted as the new period let a dead "
"sensor become the tracker's idea of normal (36 % of a revolution "
"reporting `Ok` with an error up to 120 degrees), and a **short** one -- "
"six samples of a sliver-thin but genuine sector just after a fault "
"cleared (375 us against a 3.5 ms true period) -- poisoned the reference "
"so that every real interval afterwards looked late, i.e. `State` forever."
msgstr ""
"参考周期会被任何到来的间隔更新，包括本身就是故障证据的那一个。两个实例，方向相反：一个 **加倍** "
"的间隔被采纳为新周期，于是一个坏死的传感器成了跟踪器眼中的正常（一圈里 36 % 的时间报 `Ok` ，误差达 120 度）；一个 **过短** "
"的间隔——故障刚清除后一个极窄但真实的扇区的六个采样（375 us，真实周期3.5ms）——毒化了参考，此后每个真实间隔都显得迟到，即永远 "
"`State` 。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:501 2dd18ee8f7444cb58761c238141ad506
msgid ""
"Measuring the stuck-sensor case rather than assuming the fault channels "
"covered it, and tracing the recovery path sample by sample when the "
"status refused to return to `Ok` after the fault cleared."
msgstr "靠测卡死传感器那个情形，而不是假定故障通道已经覆盖了它；并在故障清除后状态拒绝回到 `Ok` 时，逐采样点追踪恢复路径。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:503 440053a7362345d49c9c094409a12e4f
msgid ""
"The interval test is now a two-sided band around the last period, and an "
"interval outside it is refused instead of adopted. Measured effect on the"
" dead-sensor run: the undetected fraction fell from 36 % to 8.4 % without"
" the false alarm on a healthy set changing at all (0 of 1280)."
msgstr ""
"间隔检验现在是以上一周期为中心的双侧带，落在带外的间隔被拒绝而不是被采纳。在死传感器那轮上的实测效果：未检出比例从 36 % 降到 8.4 "
"%，而健康组上的误报丝毫未变（1280 个里 0 个）。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:507 da9228b2509b4d5193b9e3bf31a9610f
msgid "F-12"
msgstr "F-12"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:509 8751ff02d6774bc1b0aee1f4e69a5998
msgid ""
"Two things about a transition that crosses a stretch of illegal reads. "
"The crossing happened without being seen, yet the interval spanning it "
"was spent as a measurement; and the direction was taken from the shorter "
"arc of the code jump, which for a four-sector gap reads as two sectors "
"backwards."
msgstr "关于一次跨过一段非法读数的跳变，有两点。这次穿越发生了却没有被看到，而跨越它的那个间隔却被拿来当测量用掉了；方向取自码跳变的短弧，而对于四段扇区的缺口，短弧读出来是倒退两段。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:512 e01242fb688e4730b06f6c183a7fd5fc
msgid ""
"The dead-sensor trace: the recovery edge was 119 degrees from the truth "
"while the status said `Ok`."
msgstr "死传感器轨迹：恢复边沿与真值相差 119 度，而状态说 `Ok` 。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:513 653203f4868f40c983bacde125337cc2
msgid ""
"A crossing during an illegal read is now marked unobserved and its "
"interval refused; and when the jump is too far for the short arc to be "
"meaningful, the direction falls back on the sign of the last known speed."
" Worst undetected error 120 -> 59 degrees on the low-stuck sensor."
msgstr ""
"非法读数期间的穿越现在被标记为未观测，其间隔被拒绝；当跳变太远、短弧失去意义时，方向退回用最后已知转速的符号。低端卡死的传感器上，最坏未检出误差从"
" 120 度降到 59 度。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:517 bf9f405f50d44baa99a8604901290cd6
msgid "F-13"
msgstr "F-13"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:519 be1f63e801ee4de3babdfa21f5a72f02
msgid ""
"The transition that carried a refused interval reported `Ok`. The verdict"
" was stored, and then the very sample that produced it returned `Ok` "
"unconditionally, so the next period said `State` and the one sample in "
"between -- the one holding the largest error of the run, 119 degrees -- "
"claimed to be a measurement."
msgstr ""
"承载了一个被拒间隔的那次跳变，报的却是 `Ok` 。判决被存了下来，随后产生该判决的那个采样无条件返回 `Ok` ，于是下一个周期说 "
"`State` ，而夹在中间的那一个采样——也就是整轮里误差最大的那个，119 度——声称自己是一次测量。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:522 51a88455cc004e81848008c439c81ff5
msgid ""
"Reading the trace rather than the aggregate: the worst undetected sample "
"sat exactly on a transition, which is where the status assignment and the"
" verdict were separated by one line."
msgstr "靠读轨迹而不是读汇总：最坏的未检出采样恰好落在一次跳变上，而正是在那里，状态赋值与判决被一行代码隔开。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:524 e8f5b3464fcb4040abebef94527d3686
msgid "The status of a transition now follows its own interval verdict."
msgstr "一次跳变的状态现在跟随它自己那个间隔的判决。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:526 95820ae7ce6b49e2965b0c00622f9cf4
msgid "C-8"
msgstr "C-8"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:528 0583338584884f5b9b61db3f22e8b810
msgid ""
"Three claims about `HallTracker` were wrong before any code shipped: that"
" the angle \"freezes\" during an illegal read (it free-runs and is "
"*clamped*, because the angle is a function of time); that the two fault "
"channels \"cover\" a dead sensor (they cover roughly two thirds of a "
"revolution); and that while `State` is up the angle is \"still good to a "
"few degrees\" (at 20000 rad/s^2 it is 42 degrees out, which is what makes"
" the flag load-bearing rather than decorative)."
msgstr ""
"关于 `HallTracker` 的三条断言在任何一个代码交付之前就是错的：一是角度在非法读数期间“冻结”（实际是自由转动并被 *钳位* "
"，因为角度是时间的函数）；二是那两个故障通道能“覆盖”一个坏死的传感器（它们大约覆盖一圈的三分之二）；三是 `State` "
"亮起时角度“仍准确到几度之内”（在 20000 rad/s^2 下偏差 42度，正是这一点让该标志成为承重的，而不是装饰性的）。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:533 aea959a28ac64f8ab84ba4da7a50ce96
msgid ""
"Each one failed its own case on the first run, in the direction of the "
"case rather than of the code -- the signature of a claim written from "
"expectation instead of from the artefact."
msgstr "每一条都在第一次运行时让自己的用例失败，而且是朝着用例的方向失败，不是朝着代码的方向——这是一条照着期望而不是照着产物写下的断言所特有的印记。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:535 c2599f5cb9194ac3b535c7d0d30db0d2
msgid ""
"The three cases now assert the measured behaviour and quote the numbers, "
"including the 42 degrees, which is the evidence for \"a loop on this "
"estimate must stop when the status says so\"."
msgstr "这三条用例现在断言实测行为并引用具体数字，包括那 42 度——它是“基于这个估计的环路必须在状态如此指示时停下”的证据。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:538 00001af930fc4eec8ef2587fa878b9c0
msgid "A-18"
msgstr "A-18"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:540 1d9b4615a2ed4dcdbb14a549756a64ec
msgid ""
"The first rig that measured the dead band was scaled so that a 20 mrad "
"step demanded 1 N*m against a 3 A current limit: the loop saturated on "
"the first period and limit-cycled at 125 mrad, and the file measured that"
" instead of the friction. The module was never wrong; the instrument was."
msgstr ""
"最初测量死区的那个台架，标定使得 20 mrad 的阶跃要求 1 N*m，而电流限值是3 A：环路在第一个周期就饱和，并以 125 mrad "
"做极限环，文件测到的是这个，而不是摩擦。模块从来没错；错的是仪器。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:543 0dc45a2d52534d0281c45d815d6ff202
msgid ""
"The trajectory print rather than the summary: `theta` swinging between "
"-26 and +125 mrad while the demanded torque sat on the clamp for most of "
"every cycle. Two symptoms pointed the same way -- the \"compensated\" run"
" did not settle either, and the ripple was 1.14 N*m when the term being "
"added was 0.010."
msgstr ""
"靠打印轨迹而不是看汇总： `theta` 在 -26 与 +125 mrad "
"之间摆动，而需求转矩在每个周期的大部分时间里都顶在钳位上。两个症状指向同一处——“补偿后”的那一轮同样没有稳定下来，而且叠加项只有 0.010 "
"时纹波却是 1.14 N*m。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:546 07961e204d504443bdd27e9411297437
msgid ""
"A velocity damping term (as any real position loop has) and a step that "
"stays inside the current limit. The dead band is set by the proportional "
"path at rest, where the damping term is zero, so the arithmetic being "
"checked did not change: 4.003 and 2.021 mrad against 4.0 and 2.0."
msgstr ""
"加一个速度阻尼项（任何真实的位置环都有），并让阶跃留在电流限值之内。死区由静止时的比例通路决定，此时阻尼项为零，所以被检查的算术没有变：4.003"
" 与2.021 mrad，对照 4.0 与 2.0。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:550 31eec2636f414bc3bcf3a9b9d3bf4f30
msgid "A-19"
msgstr "A-19"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:552 008df32306ef4355add3062db9ac7c8e
msgid ""
"I predicted that an over-estimate past the breakaway would park the axis "
"`(coulomb - static)/kp` on the *wrong side* of the target. It does not: "
"the latch turns around as soon as the demand passes the term, so there is"
" no such equilibrium -- with the reference held at zero the axis simply "
"walks away, and the size of the walk is set by where the loop's own "
"demand finally balances the compensation."
msgstr ""
"我预测：越过起转点的过估计会把轴停到目标 *错误的一侧* ，偏移量为 `(coulomb- static)/kp` "
"。并非如此：只要需求越过该项，锁存就会掉头，所以并不存在这样的平衡点——参考保持在零时，轴只是一直走开，走开的量由环路自身需求最终与补偿平衡的位置决定。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:556 35f0777dabc14eddbca0d4839a4c48e5
msgid ""
"Measuring it instead of deriving it: 114 mrad of excursion in the first "
"attempt and 5.625 mrad of net travel in the second, against a predicted 2"
" mrad in the wrong direction."
msgstr "靠测量而不是靠推导：第一次尝试偏移 114 mrad，第二次净位移 5.625 mrad，而预测是朝错误方向 2 mrad。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:558 bbffd543b6df4ce483481b67e6a5da9e
msgid ""
"The case asserts the measured behaviour. The point survives and is "
"sharper than the prediction: an estimate above the breakaway is a motor, "
"and `validate()` can only catch the version of it that shows up in the "
"numbers."
msgstr ""
"用例断言的是实测行为。论点站住了，而且比预测更锋利：高于起转点的估计相当于一台电动机，而 `validate()` "
"只能抓住它体现在数字里的那种形态。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:561 582e90c8f4a340f4acaaaa98286723a8
msgid "C-9"
msgstr "C-9"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:563 a18996c9a7154964b9152e8ce47436f4
msgid ""
"The first criterion for \"the residual drops\" was a single step's final "
"position. It is not reproducible: where inside the dead band the "
"trajectory happens to stop depends on the step size and the ringing, and "
"the same three mechanisms read 2.9, 1.1 and 0.24 mrad at 20, 20 and 200 "
"mrad steps -- a criterion that would have been \"fixed\" by choosing the "
"step that made it look right."
msgstr ""
"“残差下降”的第一条判据是单次阶跃的终位。它不可复现：轨迹恰好停在死区内的哪个位置，取决于阶跃大小与振铃，同样三种机制在 20、20 和 200 "
"mrad 的阶跃下读到 2.9、1.1 和 0.24 mrad——这是一条只要挑一个让它看起来对的阶跃就能被“修好”的判据。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:567 bbc14f054c7946e0adfce65c891fd951
msgid ""
"Measuring the same mechanism at three step sizes and getting three "
"answers, which is a property of the criterion and not of the mechanism."
msgstr "靠把同一机制在三种阶跃大小下各测一次、得到三个答案，而这属于判据的性质，不属于机制的性质。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:569 c7c7bdd22662444994928f07881a0638
msgid ""
"The dead band itself is measured instead, by bisection on the reference "
"step: a threshold, not a snapshot of a trajectory, and it lands on the "
"arithmetic to four digits."
msgstr "改为直接测量死区本身，用参考阶跃做二分：一个阈值，而不是轨迹的一次快照，而且它落在算术值上，吻合四位有效数字。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:572 0758c57b687b41fdbd99e0c9da4103ca
msgid "A-20"
msgstr "A-20"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:574 36b21d97c3bd4ef19825c72ecc1cf45a
msgid ""
"The soft-limit case asserted the *ideal* invariant `v^2 <= 2*a*d` on the "
"plant's own state, and failed by 19 mm. The invariant is true of the "
"**command** from the instant the ceiling bites; the axis needs a delay "
"before the braking deceleration arrives, and during that delay it keeps "
"travelling at `v`."
msgstr ""
"软限位用例在被控对象自己的状态上断言 *理想* 不变式 `v^2 <= 2*a*d` ，差了19mm 失败。该不变式自上限生效的那一刻起对 "
"**指令** 成立；轴需要一段时延，制动减速度才到，而在这段时延里它仍以 `v` 前进。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:577 be5ed7f32bc9415fbac8066340d6bc50
msgid ""
"The failure message did not say \"wrong criterion\", it said \"the shaped"
" run reached the wall\", and the trajectory showed the axis pinned at "
"maximum braking from the moment the ceiling appeared -- i.e. the loop was"
" doing everything it could."
msgstr "失败信息没有说“判据错了”，它说“整形后的一轮撞到了墙上”，而轨迹显示轴从上限出现的那一刻起就以最大制动钉住——也就是说，环路已经尽力了。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:580 82496d474707496e908186bcd6cc2893
msgid ""
"19 mm at 19.5 rad/s is 1 ms of travel, so the missing term was `v*dt`. "
"With it the ceiling becomes `v^2 <= 2*a*(d - v*dt)` and the axis stops "
"1.04 mm short. The case now runs all three: with the term, without it, "
"and with no shaper at all."
msgstr ""
"19.5 rad/s 下 19 mm 就是 1 ms 的行程，所以缺的项是 `v*dt` 。加上它之后，上限变成 `v^2 <= 2*a*(d -"
" v*dt)` ，轴停在还差 1.04 mm 处。用例现在跑三种：带该项、不带该项、以及完全不用整形器。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:584 261e461c69904b4196fa629aac8368fb
msgid "A-21"
msgstr "A-21"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:586 fd0108acf1e44ff59966b43cd1a5b9c7
msgid ""
"The first synchronisation measurement compared a *step* response and read"
" 58 mrad, which I attributed to the ramp lag `v*kd/kp`. It was not: a "
"step has no ramp, and what the number contained was the slave loop's own "
"ringing for the first 0.09 s."
msgstr ""
"第一次同步测量比较的是 *阶跃* 响应，读到 58 mrad，我把它归因于斜坡滞后 `v*kd/kp` "
"。并非如此：阶跃没有斜坡，那个数里含的是从动环路自己在前 0.09 s内的振铃。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:589 5ebcf8b8b2ea438f946097709a8ba78b
msgid ""
"Measuring a ramp instead -- and, separately, feeding the gear the ideal "
"ramp rather than the master's measured position -- separated the three "
"contributions: 25.6 mrad from the formula, +4 mrad from the master's own "
"tracking, and the rest from the transient."
msgstr ""
"改为测斜坡——并且另外把理想斜坡而不是主轴实测位置喂给齿轮——把三部分分开了：25.6 mrad 来自公式，+4 mrad "
"来自主轴自身的跟踪，其余来自暂态。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:592 d1670d50c49c4536807e475eebdb555f
msgid ""
"The case now asserts the formula on an ideal ramp, its two scalings (`v` "
"and `kp`), and the residue the velocity feedforward leaves behind."
msgstr "用例现在在理想斜坡上断言该公式、它的两种缩放（ `v` 与 `kp` ），以及速度前馈留下的残差。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:595 0de4503005d04549a03780a60324c6d0
msgid "C-10"
msgstr "C-10"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:597 4ec62cd9e8b8418f8c7da94d7adccecc
msgid ""
"The criterion for the geared pair was \"sync error below 2 mrad\", "
"written before the mechanism was understood. A perfectly geared pair "
"cannot meet it: the standing lag is `v*kd/kp`, which is 25 mrad at the "
"configuration used. The criterion was wrong by an order of magnitude in "
"the direction that would have had me raise `kp` until the number passed "
"-- buying accuracy with the stability margin, and hiding the real lesson."
msgstr ""
"齿轮对的判据是“同步误差低于 2 mrad”，写在机制被理解之前。一对完全理想的齿轮也达不到它：稳态滞后是 `v*kd/kp` ，在所用配置下为 "
"25 mrad。判据错了一个数量级，而且错的方向恰好会让我一直加大 `kp` 直到数字过关——用稳定裕度换精度，同时把真正的教训藏起来。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:601 12cdaadfc20948c6b9ed360fcd673ef6
msgid ""
"The measurement landing 25.6 mrad against a 2 mrad criterion, and the "
"arithmetic explaining it exactly."
msgstr "测量值落在 25.6 mrad，而判据是 2 mrad，算术又把它解释得严丝合缝。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:602 a3406800d700461996cff5e69ff3ed67
msgid ""
"The criterion is the formula, in both of its arguments, plus the velocity"
" feedforward as the only term that removes it. \"Small\" is no longer a "
"criterion anywhere in that case."
msgstr "判据就是那条公式，两个自变量都测，再加速度前馈作为唯一能消除它的项。“小”在那个用例里已不再是任何判据。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:605 459cd44481f7448ca5f1a6eb8392ecab
msgid "A-22"
msgstr "A-22"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:607 82431e78bcaa48e38843b155957c29ed
msgid ""
"The first high-speed ceiling case asserted the *flux* ratio against the "
"*ceiling* ratio -- the two are inverses -- and expected the weakened "
"operating point to need *more* voltage at the unweakened ceiling, when "
"the whole point of weakening is that it needs less (12.22 V against a "
"13.86 V ceiling)."
msgstr ""
"第一条高速上限用例拿 *磁链* 比去对 *上限* 比——两者互为倒数——并且期望弱磁后的工作点在未弱磁的上限下需要 *更多* "
"电压，而弱磁的全部意义就是它需要更少（12.22 V，对 13.86 V 的上限）。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:610 5e982d0f03014d529e562e136e319845
msgid ""
"Both assertions failed with numbers that contradicted the claim rather "
"than the model: 1.2019 against 0.832, and 12.22 V where `> v_max` was "
"expected."
msgstr "两条断言都失败，而数字顶撞的是断言而不是模型：1.2019 对 0.832，以及12.22V，而那里期望的是 `> v_max` 。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:612 8dbd683bcd95409ba08974d716d70859
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The ceiling is now bisected on the plant's own steady state, which "
"produced the more interesting answer: the naive `v_max/psi_f` is 4 % "
"optimistic and weakening lifts the ceiling by 1.188 rather than the 1.202"
" the flux ratio promises."
msgstr ""
"上限现在在被控对象自己的稳态上二分，得到的答案更有意思：朴素的 `v_max/psi_f` 偏乐观 4 %，而弱磁把上限抬高 "
"1.188，不是磁链比所承诺的1.202。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:616 1a721e5aed0943ac92c6ed766534f6e0
msgid "C-11"
msgstr "C-11"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:618 d64f03ae49074e05beb9172dc0be0776
msgid ""
"The sampling-ratio case was written with a 0.02 rad bound on the "
"observer's angle error at 40 samples per electrical cycle. The open-loop "
"flux integrator, seeded and fed correctly, measures **0.121 rad at 200 "
"rad/s and 0.080 at 600** -- a bias it carries whatever the sampling "
"ratio, and the bound was invented rather than measured."
msgstr ""
"采样比那一条用例写的是：每个电气周期 40 个采样下，观测器角度误差不超过0.02 rad。开环磁链积分器在正确播种并正确馈入后实测 **200 "
"rad/s 时0.121rad、600 rad/s 时 0.080** ——这是它无论采样比如何都带着的偏置，而那个界是编出来的，不是量出来的。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:621 63b7390fb0ff4b7cb5293fcc2887ce99
msgid ""
"The measurement itself, once the flux was seeded: the error did not fall "
"with the bound relaxed, it stayed where the bias lives."
msgstr "磁链播种之后的测量本身就说明了：放宽界，误差并没有下降，它停在偏置所在的位置。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:623 41c8f61baec84ad6bc09900812d787e2
msgid ""
"The criterion is now the *ratio* effect that is actually there: speed-"
"independent at a fixed 40 samples per cycle, and 4.7x worse at 8 (0.380 "
"rad against 0.080). The bias is published as a boundary instead of being "
"asserted away."
msgstr ""
"判据现在改成实际存在的那个 *比值* 效应：固定每周期 40 个采样时与转速无关，每周期 8 个采样时差 4.7 倍（0.380 rad 对 "
"0.080）。偏置作为边界发布，而不是被断言掉。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:626 303ca1f39a9b474e9c2d2b707a8140fb
msgid "A-23"
msgstr "A-23"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:628 dbb4e2d26ba64b9e8b6b36b8c13dc578
msgid ""
"I reported \"12 gates green\" as if the online CI had been exercised, "
"then pushed 25 commits and read the run as \"everything else passed\". It"
" had not run anything: build, tests, docs, security and cross-compile are"
" each started by an emoji in the commit messages "
"(`:building_construction:`, `:beer:`, `:book:`, `:shield:`, "
"`:hammer_and_wrench:`), and `metadata.json` only grants *permission*. "
"Every commit in the push carried `:sparkles:`, `:bug:`, `:memo:` or "
"`:wrench:`, so the controller logged five `false` and the run went green "
"in 20 seconds with every substantive job skipped -- a green that means "
"\"nothing ran\", which is the same shape as A-13 (a criterion that "
"bypassed its own subject)."
msgstr ""
"我报了“12 个门禁全绿”，仿佛线上 CI 已被跑过，随后推了 25 "
"个提交，并把那次运行读成“其余全部通过”。它什么也没跑：构建、测试、文档、安全和交叉编译各由提交信息里的一个 emoji 启动（ "
"`:building_construction:` 、 `:beer:` 、 `:book:` 、 `:shield:` 、 "
"`:hammer_and_wrench:` ），而 `metadata.json` 只授予 *许可* 。这次推送里每个提交带的是 "
"`:sparkles:` 、 `:bug:` 、 `:memo:` 或 `:wrench:` ，于是控制器记下五个 `false` ，运行在 20"
" 秒内变绿、每个实质作业都被跳过——一个意味着“什么都没跑”的绿，与 A-13（绕开自身对象的判据）同形。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:635 e086138dcb784ad196adb5a4ade2ef69
msgid ""
"Reading the Log Decisions job rather than the run's conclusion. The "
"conclusion was `success`; the job said `Build: false, Tests: false, Docs:"
" false, Security: false, Cross compile: false`."
msgstr ""
"靠读 Log Decisions 这个作业，而不是读运行的结论。结论是 `success` ；作业说 `Build: false, Tests: "
"false, Docs: false, Security: false,Crosscompile: false` 。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:637 3580f310d5db4036ab051205bd1a538a
msgid ""
"The local gates are not a substitute for the pipelines, and the trigger "
"set is the five emojis above. A commit that carries them is the only way "
"to exercise the sweep, so that is what this row's own commit does."
msgstr "本地门禁不是流水线的替代品，触发集合就是上面那五个 emoji。带它们的提交是触发这一轮扫描的唯一方式，所以这一行自己的提交就这么做。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:640 bc8f42241a3d4b469ffcc17cdbd3a36c
msgid "F-14"
msgstr "F-14"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:642 2123d48c81ef4d7da6bf194c953e4a85
msgid ""
"The FMU gate searched for the FMI headers in exactly one place, "
"`workspace/materials/FMPy/src/fmpy/c-code`, a gitignored local checkout. "
"CI installs FMPy with `pip`, and the wheel ships the same unmodified "
"`fmi2Functions.h` inside `fmpy/c-code`; the gate meanwhile had already "
"proved an importable FMPy existed, because `_fmpy_python()` imports it. "
"So it failed with \"fmi2Functions.h not found; pass --fmpy\" on the one "
"machine where the header was one `import` away, and passed everywhere the"
" checkout happened to be."
msgstr ""
"FMU 门禁只在恰好一个地方找 FMI 头文件，即 `workspace/materials/FMPy/src/fmpy/c-code` "
"，那是一个被 gitignore 的本地checkout。CI 用 `pip` 安装 FMPy，而 wheel 在 `fmpy/c-code` "
"内带着同一份未经修改的 `fmi2Functions.h` ；与此同时门禁已经证明过存在可导入的 FMPy，因为 `_fmpy_python()`"
" 就在导入它。于是在那台头文件只差一个 `import` 的机器上，它因“fmi2Functions.h not found; pass "
"--fmpy”失败，而在 checkout 恰好存在的地方处处通过。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:647 672abb1e3f4f49c4b83a3d95fe8e9aaa
msgid ""
"Run 40814535913, job `Auto Testing (ubuntu-latest)`: `fmi2Functions.h not"
" found` is that job's **only** error, while `gates.py fmu` is green "
"locally where the checkout exists. Pointing `ROOT` at a path that does "
"not exist and calling `find_fmpy_headers(None)` resolved to `<site-"
"packages>/fmpy/c-code`, which is what proved the header was reachable the"
" whole time."
msgstr ""
"运行 40814535913，作业 `Auto Testing (ubuntu-latest)` ： `fmi2Functions.hnot "
"found` 是该作业 **唯一** 的错误，而在 checkout 存在的本机上 `gates.pyfmu` 是绿的。把 `ROOT` "
"指向一个不存在的路径、再调用 `find_fmpy_headers(None)` ，解析到 `<site-"
"packages>/fmpy/c-code` ，这就证明了头文件一直都可到达。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:651 c05a85b0b31943f683a277bb3beb8871
msgid ""
"The installed package's `c-code` directory joined the candidate list, the"
" checkout still searched first, and the error now names `pip install "
"fmpy` as the alternative. A gate's search path is part of its "
"precondition: if it accepts a machine it must be able to run there."
msgstr ""
"已安装包的 `c-code` 目录加入了候选列表，checkout 仍然先被搜索，而错误信息现在把 `pip install fmpy` "
"列为替代方案。门禁的搜索路径是它前提条件的一部分：它若接受一台机器，就必须能在那里运行。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:655 3dd75d2578334a5d9533b7f3df743e59
msgid "F-15"
msgstr "F-15"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:657 e7ecf55a83ae4851bf629a131b51cfac
msgid ""
"The optional python consumer imported `numpy` at module scope, and "
"nothing declared it. The test job installed conan, then built and ran the"
" suite; numpy arrived later in the same job, as a transitive dependency "
"of `fmpy==0.3.32` installed for the FMU gate. On Ubuntu the "
"`ModuleNotFoundError` cost the case 0.04 s and printed nothing, so it "
"read like a broken binding rather than a missing wheel."
msgstr ""
"可选的 python 消费方在模块作用域导入 `numpy` ，而没有任何地方声明它。测试作业先装 conan，再构建并运行测试套件；numpy "
"随后才在同一次作业里到达，成为为 FMU 门禁安装的 `fmpy==0.3.32` 的传递依赖。在 Ubuntu 上，这个 "
"`ModuleNotFoundError` 让用例只花 0.04 s 且什么都没打印，于是读起来像绑定坏了，而不像缺了一个 wheel。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:661 f2b4e0c978934bb9ad94c5cca00adc2b
msgid ""
"Two line numbers in one log: the failing case at 2415, the `pip install "
"fmpy` that would have supplied numpy at 2585. Locally the same case "
"passes in 0.80 s, because this box has numpy. The import is not only the "
"test's own: it also arrives through the project's reference analyser "
"(`benchmark/script/analyze.py`, `montecarlo.py`), which imports numpy at "
"module scope -- so the wheel is needed by the comparison against a second"
" implementation, which is a choice this project made."
msgstr ""
"同一个日志里的两个行号：失败的用例在 2415 行，本来能供上 numpy 的那条 `pip install fmpy` 在 2585 "
"行。本机上同一个用例 0.80 s 就通过，因为这台机器有 numpy。这个导入不只用例自己的：它还会经由项目的参考分析器（ "
"`benchmark/script/analyze.py` 、 `montecarlo.py` ）出现，后者在模块作用域导入 "
"numpy——于是这个 wheel 是与第二份实现做对照所需要的，而那份对照是本项目自己做的选择。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:666 65579cadec6c4f81b9fa7fd421e1251c
msgid ""
"Declared by the project, installed by a file: "
"`test_package/test/python/requirements.txt` carries `numpy>=2.0`, and the"
" shared test job runs `pip install -r` on that path **if it exists**. The"
" workflow names a file, never a package, so a derived project with no "
"such file pays nothing and one with different needs writes its own list. "
"The case itself now fails with a sentence that names the missing "
"dependency, instead of a bare `ModuleNotFoundError` in 0.04 s. Two "
"earlier fixes were withdrawn and are worth keeping: the first installed "
"numpy from a step gated on a boolean that never fired (F-16), and both "
"wrote a project's choice of reference implementation into a file every "
"derived project shares. The dependency was never the defect; the "
"*undeclared* dependency was."
msgstr ""
"由项目声明，由一个文件安装： `test_package/test/python/requirements.txt` 携带 "
"`numpy>=2.0` ，共享的测试作业 **若该路径存在** 就对其执行 `pipinstall-r` "
"。工作流点名的是一个文件，从不点名包，于是没有这个文件的派生项目什么都不用付，需求不同的项目写自己的清单。用例本身现在失败的句子里点名缺失的依赖，而不是"
" 0.04 s 后一句光秃秃的 `ModuleNotFoundError` "
"。此前两次修复被撤回，但值得记住：第一次从一个由永远不会触发的布尔量门控的步骤里装 "
"numpy（F-16），而两次都把一个项目对参考实现的选择写进了每个派生项目共用的文件。依赖从来不是缺陷； *未声明* 的依赖才是。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:675 c6d60253e7494fd698b232bf8f3f512b
msgid "A-24"
msgstr "A-24"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:677 a66f2cafc0de4eddabbf4c75dc520a78
msgid ""
"Asked whether deleting the FMU step would turn CI green, I answered \"no,"
" the tests run first and they fail\". Both halves were wrong. The ctest "
"failure never reached the job at all (A-25), so it could not have been "
"the cause; and the FMU step was the job's **only** red. I had argued from"
" the step order in the workflow file, which proves sequence and says "
"nothing about causation."
msgstr ""
"被问到删掉 FMU 步骤能否让 CI 变绿时，我答“不能，测试先跑，而它们失败了”。两半都错。ctest "
"的失败根本没有到达这个作业（A-25），所以它不可能是原因；而 FMU 步骤才是该作业 **唯一** "
"的红。我是从工作流文件里的步骤顺序推的，那只能证明先后，对因果什么也没说。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:681 0f847f72e38e4f9880622ea872580676
msgid ""
"The log has exactly one `##[error]`, at line 2659, inside the FMU step; "
"the `python_bindings` failure at line 2415 carries no error marker and "
"the step that ran it exited 0. One grep over the whole job, instead of "
"two reads of the YAML, would have settled it."
msgstr ""
"日志里恰好一个 `##[error]` ，在第 2659 行、FMU 步骤内部；第 2415 行的 `python_bindings` "
"失败不带错误标记，跑它的那个步骤退出码是 0。对整个作业做一次 grep，而不是把 YAML 读两遍，就能定论。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:684 b388a64490a1429d87ef7e9eb4d2104d
msgid ""
"The question \"which step turned this job red\" is answered by the log's "
"error markers, not by the file's step order. Same shape as A-23: a "
"plausible story about the pipeline, believed without asking the pipeline."
msgstr ""
"“哪个步骤把这个作业弄红”这个问题，由日志里的错误标记回答，不由文件里的步骤顺序回答。与 A-23 "
"同形：一个关于流水线的看似合理的故事，没问流水线就信了。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:687 e34a8b30e3164b558f7b9cda2ba24ab5
msgid "A-25"
msgstr "A-25"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:689 f1751d8907da490a8851ad87a85d6e47
msgid ""
"A failing case could not fail the pipeline. `_run_ctest_suite` caught "
"every exception, printed `CTest Crashed:` and returned, so a suite of 526"
" cases with one red reported success to conan and the job inherited it. "
"The gate could not go red, which means the green it produced was never "
"evidence -- the same defect as A-13, one level up: a criterion that "
"bypasses its own subject."
msgstr ""
"一个失败的用例无法让流水线失败。 `_run_ctest_suite` 捕获所有异常，打印 `CTest Crashed:` 然后返回，于是一套 "
"526 个用例、其中一个红的测试套件向conan 报告成功，作业继承了它。门禁不可能变红，这意味着它产出的绿从来不是证据——与 A-13 "
"同一缺陷，只是高了一层：一条绕开自身对象的判据。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:693 1a4a9f30404341c6a692253fd1ee5a7c
#, python-format
msgid ""
"An injected `EXPECT_EQ(1, 2)` case: before the fix the step exited 0 with"
" the failure recorded only in a log nobody reads; after it, exit 1, the "
"case's own message in the output, and coverage still written (87.4 % of "
"lines) before the exception left `test()`. Online, the same shape: 526 "
"cases, one red, job green."
msgstr ""
"注入一个 `EXPECT_EQ(1, 2)` 用例：修复前该步骤退出码 0，失败只记在一份没人读的日志里；修复后退出码 "
"1，输出里有用例自己的消息，而覆盖率仍在异常离开 `test()` 之前写出（行覆盖 87.4 %）。线上是同一个形状：526 "
"个用例，一个红，作业绿。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:696 ebb9c956f96f46cf84a0ac47ac020098
msgid ""
"Archive `LastTest.log` in `finally`, collect coverage, then re-raise: "
"evidence first, failure never swallowed. ctest prints a failed case only "
"on request, and conan's `CMake.test` (2.31.2) forwards build-tool "
"arguments but not ctest ones -- its docstring points at the `CTEST_` "
"variables, and `Popen` inherits `os.environ`, so "
"`CTEST_OUTPUT_ON_FAILURE=1` is set in the recipe."
msgstr ""
"在 `finally` 里归档 `LastTest.log` 、收集覆盖率，然后再抛出：先留证据，失败绝不被吞掉。ctest "
"只在被要求时才打印失败用例，而 conan 的 `CMake.test` （2.31.2）转发构建工具的参数，不转发 ctest "
"的参数——它的docstring 指向 `CTEST_` 变量，而 `Popen` 继承 `os.environ` ，所以在配方里设置了 "
"`CTEST_OUTPUT_ON_FAILURE=1` 。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:701 f616afd2f56e4917ad184b9531c9131b
msgid "F-16"
msgstr "F-16"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:703 971c3009ff6346f6804de75e86657a46
msgid ""
"A step I added to the shared test workflow to install numpy decided "
"whether to run with `enabled=$(python3 -c \"... is True\")` and then "
"compared `\"$enabled\"` against the string `true`. Python prints `True`, "
"so the comparison never matched and the step took the else branch on "
"every machine, printing \"enable_python_bindings is off\" about a flag "
"that was on. It was inert, and it looked healthy in the diff."
msgstr ""
"我为共享测试工作流加过一个装 numpy 的步骤，它用 `enabled=$(python3 -c \"... is True\")` "
"决定是否运行，然后把 `\"$enabled\"` 与字符串 `true` 比较。Python 打印的是 `True` "
"，于是比较从未命中，该步骤在每台机器上都走了else 分支，对一个本来开着的标志打印“enable_python_bindings is "
"off”。它是惰性的，而在 diff 里看起来是健康的。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:707 b72abbe4b1c1473e9e99da84a03267dc
msgid ""
"Run 40817097696, both test legs, line 226: `enable_python_bindings is "
"off: the python consumer is not built, nothing to satisfy`, while "
"`metadata.json` says `\"enable_python_bindings\": true`. The case failed "
"40 lines later with \"numpy is missing from this interpreter\", which is "
"the only reason the gate was caught."
msgstr ""
"运行 40817097696，两条测试腿，第 226 行： `enable_python_bindings isoff:the python "
"consumer is not built, nothing to satisfy` ，而 `metadata.json` 说 "
"`\"enable_python_bindings\": true` 。用例在 40 行之后以“numpy ismissing from this"
" interpreter”失败，这是这道门禁被抓住的唯一原因。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:710 e931af0125dd4d5f8af935c580fb02fe
