"~10 s. Three later runs of the same 607 MB took 39 s, 10 s and 48 s, so "
"the cost is mirror variance rather than a constant -- which bounds what "
"caching can win: it removes the eight-minute tail, it does not make a "
"fast mirror faster. The baseline had already dealt with this: `cross-"
"compile.yml` in v0.3.1 caches `/var/cache/apt/archives`, and our copy was"
" 62 lines behind it."
msgstr ""
"运行 40840909635 在交叉编译两条腿的 `apt-get install gcc-arm-none-eabi` 上花掉 489 "
"s，而最自然的读法——“Conan 缓存坏了，所以每条腿都重装”——错了两处：所有腿都打印了 `Cache restored from key` "
"，而 Build 腿的 `conancreate` 只用了 1 s。apt 步骤自己的日志写着 `Fetched 607 MB in "
"7min51s (1290 kB/s)` ：489 s 里有 377 s 是一个慢镜像，解包 3.2 GB 大约 10 s。此后三次同样的 607"
" MB 下载分别用了 39 s、10 s 和 48 "
"s，所以代价是镜像方差而不是一个常数——这也划定了缓存能赢多少：它去掉那八分钟的尾巴，它不能让快镜像更快。基线早已处理过这件事：v0.3.1 的 "
"`cross-compile.yml` 缓存 `/var/cache/apt/archives` ，而本项目那份落后它 62 行。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:911 2854bd59f3f048d0b3e5c78ea05855d4
msgid ""
