msgstr ""
"与 v0.3.3 做逐字节比较，量到 44 个不同的文件，其中 12 个在构建与 CI 层。什么也没失败，因为分叉出去的门禁照样能跑：损害完全在 "
"*未来* 那次发布里，而一次绿色的构建是最不可能显示它的东西。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:986 8d4bf8d545494c148652c378e70df7d8
msgid ""
"The private code moved to `.github/project/` (one entry point, helpers "
"imported from the scaffold's module rather than copied), the scaffold's "
"`gates.py` and `security-linters.yml` were restored to v0.3.3 bytes, and "
"the project gates run from a new `project-gates.yml` that needs nothing "
