msgstr ""
"两处都是靠做第 0 阶段（收敛骨架分叉）发现的，不是靠任何测试：恢复后的脚本第一次运行就打印 `libfoc_cpp.a: expected "
"Machine AArch64, got` ，随后Conan 在 `build()` 内部失败。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:1102 7080e6db133641029405244913037b2f
msgid ""
"`conanfile.py` was taken from v0.3.3 verbatim after checking it contains "
"nothing private -- F-24's `_baremetal_whitelist()` is *already* upstream,"
" so the fork had no content of its own and was purely a stale copy. The "
"cross leg now builds and reports `Class=ELF64 Machine=AArch64` for both "
"archives."
msgstr ""
"`conanfile.py` 在确认不含私有内容之后从 v0.3.3 逐字取用——F-24 的 `_baremetal_whitelist()` "
"*本来* 就是上游的，所以那次分叉没有自己的内容，纯粹是一份陈旧副本。交叉腿现在能构建，并为两个归档报告 "
"`Class=ELF64Machine=AArch64` 。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:1106 6667db221c894521b855a7076be4efdb
msgid "F-38"
msgstr "F-38"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:1108 c833a3aae574411f86bda0815dcdf98e
msgid ""
"Two more forks were not project work at all. "
"`test_package/CMakeLists.txt` had **zero functional lines** of difference"
