"`foc/0.1.0` ，就挨着 x86_64 那个。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:1121 b8444f658b3c4483a339bdc6d5123ae0
msgid "A-35"
msgstr "A-35"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:1123 fe9b66a4c64a404a80084e6d42504d12
msgid ""
"The pole-pair law of A-34 was measured only against the model the claim "
"rests on: the same d-q plant the pull is made of. A sign or factor error "
"in that model moves prediction and measurement together, so the ratio "
"would stay at 0.97 while both were wrong. The law now has a witness that "
"shares nothing with it: the phase-variable plant integrates the three "
"phase fluxes directly, derives torque from magnetic co-energy, never "
"forms a d-q quantity and never uses `Kt`."
msgstr ""
"A-34 "
"的极对数律只对着该主张所依赖的那个模型测过：也就是构成拖动的那台d-q被控对象。那个模型里的符号或因子误差会让预测与测量一起移动，于是两者都错时比值仍会停在"
" 0.97。这条律现在有了一个与它不共享任何东西的见证：相变量被控对象直接积分三相磁链，从磁共能推出转矩，从不构造任何 d-q 量，也从不使用 "
"`Kt` 。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:1128 df8dbc5f3a664d36afc88b7a2b43e637
msgid ""
"The recorded duty train of one start (400 rad/s^2) was replayed into "
"`AbcPlant` and the slip crossings counted over the identical tick set. "
"Measured 62.82 rad/s -- the same number to two decimals as the d-q run --"
" against 64.66 predicted, so the ratio stays 0.972. Rotor travel 29.76 "
"rad."
msgstr ""
"把一次启动（400 rad/s^2）录下的占空比序列重放进 `AbcPlant` ，并在完全相同的 tick 集合上数转差穿越。实测 62.82 "
"rad/s——与 d-q 那次运行同到两位小数——而预测是 64.66，所以比值仍是 0.972。转子行程 29.76 rad。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:1131 7669e89886ea4ee39459e0963ae1a0fc
msgid ""
"The cross-check is asserted, not just printed, and it carries its own two"
" controls. **Liveness**: with the mechanical integration switched off the"
" same loop returns 197.9 rad/s at a saturated 3.14 rad slip, i.e. it "
"cannot produce the pendulum frequency without mechanics. **Boundary**: at"
" double inertia the rotor completes only 3 crossings (9.42 rad/s against "
"45.40 predicted), so the law is a *locked-rotor* law and stops applying "
"there -- pinned as a number in the test rather than as a sentence in a "
"document."
msgstr ""
"这项交叉检验是被断言的，不只是被打印的，而且自带两个对照。 **活性** ：关掉机械积分后，同一个环路在饱和的 3.14 rad 转差下返回 "
"197.9 rad/s，也就是说没有力学它产生不出摆动频率。 **边界** ：惯量加倍时转子只完成 3 次穿越（9.42 rad/s，预测 "
"45.40），所以这条律是一条 *堵转* 律，在那里就不适用了——这在测试里被钉成一个数字，而不是文档里的一句话。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:1137 ff09f86eb0d24fa7b394615ef5a37f47
msgid "A-36"
msgstr "A-36"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:1139 834697b5d3de4327b741b04fafa51085
msgid ""
"An L2 row was promoted to L3, which needs three things and only had two. "
"The frequency claim had an analytic anchor and (since A-35) an "
"independent witness, but no sensitivity table: the repository's own "
"definition of L3 is \"L2 **and** the sensitivity of each error source "
"**and** the phase-variable cross-check\"."
msgstr ""
"一行 L2 被提升为 L3，而它需要三样东西，却只有两样。频率主张有解析锚点，也有（自 A-35 起）一个独立的见证，但没有敏感度表：仓库自己对 "
"L3 的定义是“L2 **以及** 每个误差源的敏感度 **以及** 相变量交叉检验”。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:1142 70fc7225f6364c97af0f19d6469052a3
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Eleven model error sources were injected one at a time into the same "
"start, at the magnitudes `test_sil_sensitivity.cpp` already uses. The "
"oscillation frequency stayed within 3.3 % of the clean run for every one;"
" the worst slip stayed within +18.2 %. One source is material: "
"**differential sensor gain** (`u+10 v-10 %`, +18.2 % slip), so it goes on"
" the user-must-measure list. The `sources` order in the test is anchored "
"**by name** rather than by index, so inserting a row cannot silently re-"
"point an assertion."
msgstr ""
"十一个模型误差源被逐个注入同一个启动过程，量级沿用 `test_sil_sensitivity.cpp` "
"已在用的那些。振荡频率对每一个源都保持在干净运行的 3.3 % 之内；最坏转差保持在 +18.2 % 之内。有一个源是有影响的： "
"**差分传感器增益** （ `u+10 v-10 %` ，转差 +18.2 %），所以它进了“用户必须测量”的清单。测试里 `sources` "
"的顺序按 **名字** 锚定而不是按索引，于是插入一行不可能悄悄把某条断言指到别处。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:1147 526403bd56fd442f8fec29a6389ad9d4
msgid ""
"The table needed a new knob to be honest -- current-sense gain and offset"
" were private to `test_sil_sensitivity.cpp`'s own HAL, so the startup "
"bench could not inject them at all. They are now "
"`PlantCurrentSense::set_phase_gain/set_offset_a`, defaulting to identity."
" Two *analytic* anchors keep the table from measuring the harness: a "
"common offset moves the slip by < 0.1 % (it cancels identically in "
"Clarke), and a differential gain must move more than a uniform one "
"(phantom negative sequence vs a loop-gain scale). Both hold."
msgstr ""
"这张表要诚实就需要一个新旋钮——电流采样的增益与偏置原本是 `test_sil_sensitivity.cpp` 自己 HAL "
"的私有物，启动台架根本注入不了。它们现在是 `PlantCurrentSense::set_phase_gain/set_offset_a` "
"，默认是恒等。两个 *解析* 锚点防止这张表去测台架本身：共模偏置使转差变化 < 0.1 %（它在Clarke "
"变换里完全抵消），而差分增益必须比均匀增益动得更多（虚假负序，对照环路增益尺度）。两条都成立。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:1154 3b301e4f9b604d2cae675147fa43f80a
msgid "A-37"
msgstr "A-37"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:1156 7f9d73a2600742829a8c8cc4704513b7
msgid ""
"The first rule set for that table was mine and it was wrong. It declared "
"\"a source that moves the slip by 2 %-20 %\" a red state -- neither "
"negligible nor actionable. It went red, on exactly the two sensor-gain "
"rows (2.2 % and 18.2 %), which is the signature of a rule that describes "
"where two thresholds were placed rather than the machine."
msgstr ""
"那张表的第一套规则是我定的，而它是错的。它把“使转差变化 2 %-20 % "
"的源”判成红状态——既不算可忽略，也不算可行动。它变红了，恰好红在那两行传感器增益上（2.2 % 与 18.2 "
"%），这正是一条只描述两个阈值被放在哪里、而不描述电机的规则的印记。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:1160 4266c3836c9a41c9a944fe568f15bcee
msgid ""
"The red came from the first run of the rule, before any threshold was "
"moved to accommodate it."
msgstr "这次红来自该规则的第一次运行，在任何阈值被挪去迁就它之前。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:1161 21bec308ca2b4f4cae15c5145b92a500
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Replaced by two arithmetic anchors (A-36). A second instrument error was "
"found in the same pass: the frequency was counted as `pi * crossings / "
"pull_s`, quantised at 3.14 rad/s = 5 % of the value, which made every "
"\"unchanged\" cell a statement about the counting. "
"`slip_frequency_rad_s()` times the crossings instead, and the test "
"asserts the timed and the counted value agree within 2 % so the two "
"measures cannot drift apart."
msgstr ""
"改由两个算术锚点取代（A-36）。同一遍里还发现了第二处仪器错误：频率被算成 `pi * crossings / pull_s` ，量化在 "
"3.14 rad/s 上，等于该值的 5 %，于是一个个“未变”的单元格都成了关于计数的陈述。 `slip_frequency_rad_s()` "
"改为给穿越计时，而测试断言计时值与计数值的差在 2 % 之内，这样两种测量无法彼此漂开。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:1166 5e9826b652ce458cb332907524526a0b
msgid "F-39"
msgstr "F-39"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:1168 309f891a8ae644da9058f4f3c258e662
msgid ""
"An origin could not exist through the C ABI at all. `PositionReference` "
"is advanced only while the commutation angle comes from the *observer* "
"(`speed_from_observer || injecting_now()`), and "
"`CallbackPosition::has_sensor()` was hard-coded `true` with "
"`velocity_rad_s()` returning `0.0` (not `NaN`) when the callback was "
"absent. So `speed_from_observer` was always false on the host path: the "
"reference never advanced, `homed()` could never become true, and "
"\"absolute position\" was a concept the C surface could neither reach nor"
" report. The gap was invisible because the C surface never mentioned it, "
"and the C++ path (which the SIL tests use) has "
"`PlantPosition::set_sensor_present(false)`."
msgstr ""
"原点通过 C ABI 根本不可能存在。 `PositionReference` 只在换相角来自 *观测器* 时才被推进（ "
"`speed_from_observer || injecting_now()` ），而 "
"`CallbackPosition::has_sensor()` 硬编码为 `true` ， `velocity_rad_s()` "
"在回调缺失时返回 `0.0` （不是 `NaN` ）。于是在宿主路径上 `speed_from_observer` 永远是假：参考从不推进， "
"`homed()` 永远不会变真，而“绝对位置”成了 C 接口既够不到也报不出的概念。这个缺口不可见，因为 C 接口从未提到它，而 C++ "
"路径（SIL 测试用的那条）有 `PlantPosition::set_sensor_present(false)` 。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:1175 159d9aaa6f0142ae80dfe281d73b5cfa
msgid ""
"Asking what a caller could *do* with the refusal I had just added: the "
"answer was \"nothing, forever\". A query whose success branch cannot be "
"reached is a deleted feature with extra steps, so the branch was traced "
"back to the flag that keeps it false."
msgstr ""
"去问调用方对我刚加上的那个拒绝能 *做什么* "
"：答案是“什么也做不了，永远”。一个成功分支不可达的查询，就是一个多绕了几步的删除功能，于是这个分支被回溯到那个让它保持为假的标志。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:1178 1eb41c54b0214457a3af3db2ba35cd80
msgid ""
"Three additions, all append-only and `struct_size`-gated: "
"`foc_motor_setup_t::use_observer_angle`, the optional "
"`position_has_index`/`position_index_pulse` HAL callbacks, and "
"`HalCallbacks::valid_without_angle()` so a sensor-less host may omit the "
"angle callback (a *second predicate* rather than a flag, because "
"\"sensored host without an angle\" is a configuration mistake while "
"\"sensor-less host without one\" is the normal case, and one predicate "
"would spell them the same). The callbacks struct is an *input*, so its "
"appended fields are gated by the caller's `struct_size` -- reading them "
"unguarded would read an older caller's stack."
msgstr ""
"三处新增，全部只追加并由 `struct_size` 门控： `foc_motor_setup_t::use_observer_angle` "
"、可选的 `position_has_index` /`position_index_pulse` HAL 回调，以及 "
"`HalCallbacks::valid_without_angle()` ，好让无感宿主可以省掉角度回调（一个 *第二谓词* "
"而不是一个标志，因为“有传感的宿主却没有角度”是配置错误，而“无感宿主没有角度”是正常情形，一个谓词会把两者写成一样）。回调结构是 *输入* "
"，所以它追加的字段由调用方的 `struct_size` 门控——不加守卫地去读，会读到更早调用方的栈。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:1185 35d785a3b163405c89321667be2686f4
msgid "A-38"
msgstr "A-38"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:1187 d292c02d939640608e89c99620ddc90e
msgid ""
"The first version of the new rig returned the index as a **level** "
"(`index_edges > 0`) instead of an edge. Every tick after the crossing "
"then re-established the origin, pinning `referenced_mech_rad` at "
"`index_mech_rad`; the measurement was 0.0000 -> 0.0000 rad across 10 ms "
"of rotation at 300 rad/s."
msgstr ""
"新台架的第一版把索引作为 **电平** 返回（ `index_edges > 0` ），而不是作为一个边沿。于是穿越之后的每个 tick "
"都重新建立原点，把 `referenced_mech_rad` 钉在 `index_mech_rad` 上；测量结果是 300 rad/s 下旋转"
" 10 ms 期间 0.0000-> 0.0000 rad。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:1190 56a149f05dd441d49fe553b4d901abb7
msgid ""
"The red came from the \"it tracks the rotor\" assertion, not from a "
"compile error, and the fix was in the experiment rather than the library."
msgstr "这次红来自“它跟随转子”那条断言，不是编译错误，而修的是实验，不是库。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:1192 180120ad7a7548bdab67a0ba681b78d4
msgid ""
"Made the pulse a one-shot consumed by the next `index_pulse()` call; the "
"same measurement then gave 0.0000 -> 2.9872 rad against 3.0 expected. "
"Worth recording because `hal/position.hpp` had *already* warned about "
"exactly this failure (\"a level would count one pass thousands of "
"times\") -- a documented hazard is only a warning until someone reads it,"
" and the rig is where that has to happen."
msgstr ""
"把脉冲做成一次性、由下一次 `index_pulse()` 调用消费；同样的测量随后给出0.0000 -> 2.9872 rad，期望 "
"3.0。值得记录，是因为 `hal/position.hpp` *早已* "
"警告过正是这一种失败（“电平会把一次经过数上几千次”）——一个写进文档的危险在有人读到它之前只是个警告，而台架正是这必须发生的地方。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:1197 4e87c805740c442aabb1e8cf21518ce4
msgid "A-39"
msgstr "A-39"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:1199 179bc82e4401425d998791206a3a4f2a
msgid ""
"The positioning error budget's first metric was wrong, and it printed "
"evidence of that: an encoder of 2 mrad per count measured **-0.26 mrad**,"
" i.e. the error source made the result *better*. The cause is that "
"quantisation is **signed** -- where the residual lands between two counts"
" decides whether it helps or hurts -- and the metric was \"final error "
"minus the clean run's final error\" at a single target. A budget made of "
"such deltas can be pushed negative by one lucky target, which is the same"
" class of mistake as fitting a threshold to a run."
msgstr ""
"定位误差预算的第一条指标是错的，而它把自己错了的证据打印了出来：每计数2mrad 的编码器量到 **-0.26 mrad** "
"，也就是说这个误差源让结果 *变好* 了。原因是量化是 **带符号的** "
"——残差落在两个计数之间的哪个位置，决定它帮忙还是添乱——而那条指标是单个目标点上的“终误差减去干净一轮的终误差”。由这种差值构成的预算，会被一个走运的目标点推成负数，这与拿一轮运行去拟合阈值是同一类错误。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:1204 1fa7557d3a92424f964ef5420b60b1d1
msgid ""
"The first table's own output: baseline residual 1.252 mrad, \"encoder "
"contribution\" -0.262 mrad, and a combined measurement *below* the "
"baseline it was supposed to be an increase over."
msgstr "第一张表自己的输出：基线残差 1.252 mrad，“编码器贡献” -0.262 mrad，而合并测量值 *低于* 它本该在其之上增加的那个基线。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:1206 33011e58d2ed4cc0a373dc81563a1aa3
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The target is now swept across one count (8 points) and the worst case is"
" taken, which turns every row into a non-negative worst-case increase and"
" makes the half-count bound checkable. Measured after: baseline 1.261 "
"mrad, encoder 0.975 mrad (97.5 % of the 1.0 mrad half-count bound), "
"breakaway 0.199 mrad, dead time 0.014 mrad, combined 2.236 against a "
"budget of 2.450 (ratio 1.10). The bracket is now `measured <= budget <= "
"1.5*measured` and dropping the dominant term breaks the lower half, so a "
"missing contributor cannot pass."
msgstr ""
"目标现在在一个计数的跨度上扫（8 个点）并取最坏情形，于是每一行都变成非负的最坏情形增量，半计数界也变得可检。改后实测：基线 1.261 "
"mrad，编码器0.975 mrad（1.0 mrad 半计数界的 97.5 %），起转 0.199 mrad，死区0.014mrad，合计 "
"2.236，对照预算 2.450（比值 1.10）。夹逼条件现在是 `measured<= budget <= 1.5*measured` "
"，删掉主导项就会破坏下半边，所以不会有漏掉的贡献项混过去。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:1212 1e541301c87b44418a0145fac5365324
msgid "A-40"
msgstr "A-40"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:1214 7dae3f52b66149d88789912ed74da225
msgid ""
"C3's third gap asked for \"a closed-form bound on trajectory following "
"error\", and the answer is that this architecture has no trajectory to "
"follow: `MotionProfile` shapes a *velocity* command out of the position "
"error, it never generates a position reference. So `e = v/kp`, the "
"textbook first-order following error on a ramp, has nothing to describe "
"here."
msgstr ""
"C3 的第三个缺口要的是“轨迹跟随误差的闭式界”，而答案是这套架构没有可跟随的轨迹： `MotionProfile` 由位置误差塑出一条 *速度*"
" 指令，从不生成位置参考。于是 `e = v/kp` ——教科书里斜坡上的一阶跟随误差——在这里没有东西可描述。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:1218 47c28557d08f4387b616efd9d916b340
msgid ""
"The measurement refused the hypothesis twice over: the cruise gap came "
"out at 0.496 rad against 0.100 predicted, and doubling the shaping gain "
"left it at **0.496 as well**. The second number is the one that settles "
"it -- a quantity that does not move when its supposed parameter doubles "
"is not that parameter's."
msgstr ""
"测量两次否掉了这个假设：匀速段的缺口出来是 0.496 rad，而预测 0.100；把整定增益加倍，它仍是 **0.496** "
"。定论的是第二个数——一个在自己假定参数加倍时纹丝不动的量，不属于那个参数。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:1221 5ce23c7454ed4902ba8f4fa8a5cc8602
msgid ""
"The claim was replaced rather than widened: what the structure does bound"
" is where the cruise ends, at the deceleration threshold `v^2/(2a)` = "
"0.200 rad, and the smallest cruise gap measures 0.173 rad against it "
"(-13.7 %, asserted, with the gain-independence kept as an assertion so "
"the refuted law cannot quietly return). The README row now says so "
"instead of quoting a following-error law."
msgstr ""
"主张被替换，而不是被放宽：这套结构确实给出界的地方是匀速段结束之处，即减速阈值 `v^2/(2a)` = 0.200 "
"rad，而最小的匀速段缺口实测 0.173 rad，对照该阈值（-13.7 "
"%，已断言，并把与增益无关这一点也保留为断言，以免那条被否证的定律悄悄回来）。README 里那一行现在这么说，而不是去引用一条跟随误差定律。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:1226 d6770a6a83244ad0894d137bda625992
msgid "F-40"
msgstr "F-40"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:1228 fccda9d4cf154a41b2681ecb9b0a6d83
msgid ""
"The position-error budget's individual rows are not converged in the "
"simulation's integration substeps, so they are spot values of one setting"
" rather than measurements of the machine. The aggregate hid this: the "
"bracket looked healthy in both settings, so nothing pointed at the rows."
msgstr "位置误差预算的各行在仿真积分子步里并未收敛，所以它们是某一个设置下的点值，而不是对这台机器的测量。合计值把这一点盖住了：两种设置下夹逼条件都看着健康，于是没有任何东西指向那些行。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:1231 3ee39bd0b65f4040aa6fe8c13579d5b4
#, python-format
msgid ""
"At ``kSubsteps=4``: baseline 1.261, encoder 0.975, breakaway 0.199, dead "
"time 0.014 mrad, combined 2.236 against a budget of 2.450 (ratio 1.10). "
"At ``kSubsteps=16``: 1.673, 0.573, 0.435, 0.053 mrad, combined 2.495 "
"against 2.734 (ratio 1.10 again). The encoder row was the sharpest "
"witness because it had been quoted as **97.5 % of the arithmetic half-"
"count bound** -- a number that reads like confirmation -- and refining "
"the integrator by 4x moves it to 57 % of the same bound."
msgstr ""
"``kSubsteps=4`` 下：基线 1.261，编码器 0.975，起转 0.199，死区 0.014mrad，合计 2.236，对照预算 "
"2.450（比值 1.10）。 ``kSubsteps=16`` 下：1.673、0.573、0.435、0.053 mrad，合计 "
"2.495，对照 2.734（比值又是 1.10）。编码器那一行是最锐利的证人，因为它曾被引用为 **算术半计数界的 97.5 %** "
"——一个读起来像确认的数字——而把积分器细化 4 倍，它变成同一个界的 57 %。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:1237 46c3844aead3438b81073bc689665ead
msgid ""
"Fixed, and the fix was one line of precision: the mechanical channel is "
"integrated in double (`omega_mech`, `theta_mech`, `domega`, `dtheta` and "
"the RK4 combination), while the HAL accessors still narrow to float at "
"the boundary -- a sensor has a resolution, the physics does not. The root"
" cause is arithmetic, not control: at theta = 1.2 rad the float32 ulp is "
"1.19e-7, and a settled speed of 0.004 rad/s over a 12.5 us substep is a "
"5.0e-8 step, i.e. below half an ulp, so `static_cast<float>(theta + "
"step)` returned `theta` unchanged."
msgstr ""
"已修，而修法只是一行精度：机械通道改用 double 积分（ `omega_mech` 、 `theta_mech` 、 `domega` 、 "
"`dtheta` 以及 RK4 的组合），HAL 访问器仍在边界上收窄为 "
"float——传感器有分辨率，物理没有。根因是算术，不是控制：theta=1.2 rad 处 float32 的 ulp 是 1.19e-7，而 "
"12.5 us 子步里 0.004 rad/s 的稳态速度是 5.0e-8 的一步，即不到半个 ulp，于是 "
"`static_cast<float>(theta+step)` 原样返回 `theta` 。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:1243 b55d0dec432b4cfc9ec99b61e0ff00aa
msgid ""
"All three settings, 4 / 16 / 64 substeps: the no-friction settled offset "
"went from 200.4 / 799.9 / 3197.4 urad to **0.0 / 0.0 / 0.0**, and the "
"stiction reversal value from +233.4 / -339.7 / -3525.6 urad (sign "
"included) to a constant **+31.7 / -31.7**. The budget's four rows are now"
" stable to better than 1 % between 4 and 16 substeps."
msgstr ""
"三种设置，4 / 16 / 64 子步：无摩擦的稳态偏移从 200.4 / 799.9 /3197.4urad 变为 **0.0 / 0.0 / "
"0.0** ，静摩擦换向值从 +233.4 / -339.7 /-3525.6urad（含符号）变为常数 **+31.7 / -31.7** "
"。预算的四行现在在 4 与16 子步之间稳定到优于 1 %。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:1246 a1a359455ba644b78e4b13668b010adc
msgid ""
"The consequences were larger than the defect and are recorded rather than"
" absorbed: six cases carried numbers that only held on the frozen plant "
"-- two of them claims, not constants (A-42) -- and one had been measuring"
" its ceiling against a position the API never receives (F-41). Each was "
"re-derived or rewritten; **none was loosened**. That is the measured "
"answer to \"how much rests on this\": six cases."
msgstr ""
"后果比缺陷本身更大，而它们被记录下来，不是被吸收掉：六个用例携带的数字只在被冻住的被控对象上成立——其中两个是主张，不是常数（A-42）——还有一个一直拿"
" API 根本收不到的位置去量自己的上限（F-41）。每一个都重新推导或重写； **没有一个被放宽** "
"。这就是“有多少东西压在这上面”的实测答案：六个用例。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:1251 1a4edb7a63ea47c882ce5c909c4ac36a
msgid "A-41"
msgstr "A-41"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:1253 0ed8c2d3fc494c78a11d7dc862f74667
msgid ""
"C3's missing evidence level was pursued through an authoritative external"
" framework instead of one more internal check: ISO 230-2 / VDI/DGQ 3441 "
"define unidirectional accuracy *A*, repeatability *R* and reversal value "
"*B*, and the procedure of approaching every target from both directions. "
"The prediction was written before the measurement: *B* equals **twice** "
"the one-sided stiction displacement, with \"no stiction therefore *B* = "
"0\" as the mechanism's own control."
msgstr ""
"C3 缺失的那一级证据，是借一个权威的外部框架去追的，而不是再加一条内部检查：ISO 230-2 / VDI/DGQ 3441 定义了单向精度 "
"*A* 、重复性 *R* 与换向值 *B* ，以及“每个目标都从两个方向逼近”的步骤。预测写在测量之前： *B* 等于单侧静摩擦位移的 "
"**两倍** ，并以“没有静摩擦因此 *B* = 0”作为机制自身的对照。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:1258 38a528cc30e34cceb0415d75b26d9a4d
msgid ""
"The measurement refuted the attribution and then refuted the instrument. "
"With **zero** friction the reversal value was still 0.40 mrad at 1.2-1.8 "
"rad targets, so stiction was not the cause; and it was not a settling "
"artefact either, because extending the run from 1.2 s to 4.8 s left it "
"unchanged. Sweeping the integrator then showed what it actually was: the "
"settled offset went 200 -> 800 -> 3197 urad at 4 / 16 / 64 substeps, and "
"adding 0.2 mN*m of stiction flipped its sign (+233 -> -340 urad)."
msgstr ""
"测量否掉了这个归因，然后又否掉了仪器本身。摩擦为 **零** 时，1.2-1.8 rad的目标上换向值仍是 0.40 "
"mrad，所以静摩擦不是原因；它也不是整定过程留下的伪迹，因为把运行从 1.2 s 延长到 4.8 s "
"它毫无变化。随后扫积分器才显出它究竟是什么：稳态偏移在 4 / 16 / 64 子步下依次为 200 -> 800 -> 3197 "
"urad，而加入 0.2 mN*m 的静摩擦就让它变号（+233 -> -340 urad）。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:1263 e61da884dcc84e9897b763a70715be17
msgid ""
"Adopting the standard paid off twice. First it proved the bench could not"
" support the claim (F-40); then, once the plant's mechanical channel "
"moved to double, the same measurement returned the prediction it had "
"rejected first time: with no friction the reversal value is exactly "
"**0.0**, and with 0.2 mN*m of stiction the two directions sit at **+31.7 "
"and -31.7 urad, so B = 63.4 = 2x the one-sided displacement**, invariant "
"across substeps. **Neither P1 nor P2 was wrong; the instrument was.** The"
" test is still not in the suite: it belongs there once C3's own numbers "
"are settled, and re-adding it is now a small job rather than a blocked "
"one."
msgstr ""
"采纳这个标准收了两笔账。第一笔，它证明了台架支撑不住那个主张（F-40）；第二笔，在被控对象的机械通道改成 double "
"之后，同一次测量给出了它第一次拒掉的预测：没有摩擦时换向值恰好是 **0.0** ，而带 0.2 mN *m 静摩擦时两个方向停在* *+31.7"
" 与 -31.7 urad，于是 B = 63.4 = 单侧位移的 2 倍* *，跨子步不变。* *P1 与 P2 都没有错；错的是仪器。* * "
"这个测试仍不在套件里：等 C3 自己的数字定下来它才该进去，而现在重新加入它是件小事，不再是被卡住的事。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:1270 ece7cb6bff104684bddec706a8319f70
msgid "F-41"
msgstr "F-41"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:1272 39cad655e98c48ecb1521762f6026de0
msgid ""
"The soft-limit ceiling check in `test_soft_limit.cpp` compared the shaped"
" command against `kMaxRad - theta` computed in double, while the shaper "
"it was checking had received `theta` narrowed to float. Near the wall "
"that is catastrophic cancellation: `0.5 - theta` subtracts two nearly "
"equal numbers, so a 6e-8 rounding of `theta` is 6e-4 *relative* on the "
"1e-4 rad that is left."
msgstr ""
"`test_soft_limit.cpp` 里的软限位上限检查，把整形后的指令与在 double 里算出的 `kMaxRad - theta` "
"相比，而它检查的整形器收到的是收窄为 float 的 `theta` 。贴近限位处这是灾难性相消： `0.5 - theta` "
"相减两个几乎相等的数，于是一个 6e-8 的 `theta` 舍入，在剩下的 1e-4 rad 上是 6e-4 的 *相对* 量。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:1276 057c98f145df405ab785b96ab80eab69
msgid ""
"Invisible until F-40, because both sides then computed the same float "
"subtraction and were bit-identical. After it, one period in 4000 showed "
"the idealised command **1.308e-3** over its own ceiling. The first "
"reading of that was \"float-boundary artefact\" with a 1e-4 allowance -- "
"wrong by a factor of 13, and the giveaway was that a boundary artefact of"
" a float subtraction is 1e-7, not 1e-3."
msgstr ""
"在 F-40 之前不可见，因为那时两侧算的是同一次 float 减法，逐位相同。修好之后，4000 个周期里有一个显示理想化指令超出它自己的上限 "
"**1.308e-3** 。最初把这个读成“float 边界伪迹”并留了 1e-4 的余量——差了 13 倍，而破绽在于一次 float "
"减法的边界伪迹是 1e-7，不是 1e-3。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:1280 85a69279461244ab85cfc7853bf0e898
msgid ""
"The check now narrows the position once, to the value the shaper actually"
" receives, and the count returns to zero. Recorded because the shape "
"recurs and is not a plant defect: a checker that computes its reference "
"more precisely than the code under test can receive it is measuring a "
"machine that cannot be built."
msgstr "这项检查现在只把位置收窄一次，收到整形器真正收到的那个值，计数回到零。记录下来，是因为这种形状反复出现，而它并不是被控对象的缺陷：一个把参考算得比被测代码能收到的更精确的检查器，量的是台造不出来的机器。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:1284 2ecb50ad96ef4a8395c6737ae4ed5a49
msgid "A-42"
msgstr "A-42"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:1286 12d845933abc40499a79f458d10ce82a
msgid ""
"Fixing F-40 changed two published claims and one headline conclusion, all"
" three of which had passed every gate and been argued for in prose. This "
"is what carrying a recorded defect forward actually costs."
msgstr "修 F-40 改掉了两条已发布的主张和一条头条结论，三者都通过了全部门禁、也都在文字里被论证过。这就是把一个已记录的缺陷带到下一版的实际代价。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:1288 d441d60bd1cb45ceb3c7a8057398724d
msgid ""
"(1) The speed-ripple case concluded \"the ripple is inertia-invariant, so"
" the mechanical story is falsified\", with a mechanism (gains derived "
"from the inertia) and a number (5.9x q-ripple growth). On the corrected "
"plant ten times the inertia buys **9.16x** less ripple and the q-ripple "
"does not move at all (0.0201 A against 0.0200 A) -- the mechanical chain "
"holds and the earlier falsification described the simulator. (2) The "
"published-speed filter case claimed it removes the carrier without moving"
" the axis or costing accuracy; C10a still holds at **10.2x** and C10b is "
"still falsified, but the steady bias moves to **1.87x** against a 1.2x "
"budget, so the three-way trade does not exist at any swept cutoff. (3) "
"The position budget's headline \"the loop, not the sensor, is the "
"accuracy limit\" is a statement about the measurement window: the loop's "
"share decays to **0.000 urad** (time constant about 1 s) while the "
"encoder's half-count floor is permanent at 991 / 995 / 999 urad at 1.2 / "
"6 / 24 s."
msgstr ""
"(1) 速度纹波那条用例得出的结论是“纹波与惯量无关，所以机械那一侧的故事被否证”，并配上一个机制（增益由惯量导出）和一个数字（q 轴纹波增长 "
"5.9 倍）。在修正后的被控对象上，惯量增大十倍换来的是纹波 **小 9.16 倍** ，而 q轴纹波根本不动（0.0201 A 对照 "
"0.0200 A）——机械那一串成立，先前那次否证描述的是仿真器。(2) 转速滤波那条用例声称它去掉载波而不带动轴、也不损失精度；C10a 仍在 "
"**10.2 倍** 上成立，C10b 仍被否证，但稳态偏置变成 **1.87 倍** ，对照 1.2 "
"倍的预算，所以在扫过的任何截止频率上都不存在那个三方取舍。(3)位置预算那条头条“精度极限在环路，不在传感器”是一句关于测量窗口的话：环路所占份额衰减到"
" **0.000 urad** （时间常数约 1 s），而编码器的半计数地板是永久的，在 1.2 / 6 / 24 s 处分别为 991 / "
"995 / 999 urad。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:1298 fbe96355979b4603ab0b9bfd2b4cc194
#, python-format
msgid ""
"All three now read as what the tests assert, and each carries its old "
"value in a comment. The lesson is in the arithmetic: a defect that "
"**freezes** a state produces measurements that are stable, repeatable and"
" wrong in one direction, so repetition inside the same suite cannot find "
"it -- only a different instrument can. The relay that found it was a "
"Python float64/scipy reference (`project/gates.py plantref`), which is "
"now a gate for exactly that reason: it shares no language, no arithmetic "
"and no solver with the code it checks, and a 0.1 % error in its own "
"parameters turns it red."
msgstr ""
"三者现在都改成测试所断言的样子，各自在注释里带着旧值。教训在算术里：一个把状态 **冻住** "
"的缺陷，产生的测量稳定、可重复、且朝一个方向错，所以在同一套件里重复比对找不到它——只有换一个仪器才行。接住它的是Pythonfloat64/scipy"
" 参考实现（ `project/gates.py plantref` "
"），它正是因为这一点成为门禁：它与被检查的代码不共享语言、不共享算术、不共享求解器，而它自己参数上 0.1 % 的误差就会让它变红。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:1305 122260fc602747c4a96b31a4869aa026
msgid "A-43"
msgstr "A-43"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:1307 8ee3f4991b06492a8e5b96b67224bbb9
msgid ""
"The plant now has an instrument of its own: `project/gates.py plantref` "
"builds a scenario harness that dumps the state *and the applied phase "
"voltages* every control period, and a float64/scipy reference replays it."
" Dumping the voltage is what makes the instrument scenario-agnostic -- "
"the closed-loop case (PositionP -> PI speed -> PI current -> SVPWM) is "
"audited without one line of controller re-implemented in Python, so a "
"disagreement is unambiguously about the plant. Three audits: per-period "
"replay, energy conservation, and kinematics."
msgstr ""
"被控对象现在有了自己的仪器： `project/gates.py plantref` 构建一个场景台架，每控制周期把状态 *以及施加的相电压* "
"落盘，再由 float64/scipy 参考实现重放。把电压落盘，才使这台仪器与场景无关——闭环用例（PositionP -> PIspeed->"
" PI current -> SVPWM）在 Python "
"里不重实现一行控制器就能受审，于是任何不一致都明确地是被控对象的问题。三项审计：逐周期重放、能量守恒、以及运动学。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:1312 43e153e6fd4345a09c1da6409440bbaa
msgid ""
"Two of its design choices were forced by the instrument failing to catch "
"what it was built to catch, and both lessons are about measurement rather"
" than about the plant. (1) The per-period replay **cannot see F-40**: the"
" self-test froze the angle and every sampled period still passed, because"
" losing half an ulp per step is below any single-period tolerance and "
"only shows up when it accumulates. The accumulating audit (`theta(T) - "
"theta(0)` against `integral of omega dt`) had to be added *after* the "
"demonstration, not before it. A local-error test and a drift test are "
"different instruments. (2) Reported as a ratio of the travel, 200 urad on"
" a one-radian move is 2e-4 and passes any sane bound, while being twenty "
"times the finest claim resting on that trajectory -- so the kinematics "
"bound is **absolute radians derived from the evidence chain** (1e-5 rad, "
"a hundredth of the mrad-level position budget), not a ratio of the "
"measurement's own scale."
msgstr ""
"它的两个设计选择，都是因为仪器抓不住它本来要抓的东西而被逼出来的，而两条教训都关乎测量，不关乎被控对象。(1) 逐周期重放 **看不见 "
"F-40** ：自检把角度冻住，而每个被采样的周期仍然通过，因为每步丢半个 ulp 低于任何单周期容差，只有累积起来才显形。累积型审计（ "
"`theta(T) - theta(0)` 对照 `integralof omega dt` ）必须在演示 *之后* "
"才被加上，不是之前。局部误差测试和漂移测试是不同的仪器。(2) 若按行程之比报告，一弧度行程上 200 urad "
"是2e-4，任何像样的界都放它过去，而它却是压在那条轨迹上的最精细主张的二十倍——所以运动学界是 **由证据链推出的绝对弧度** （1e-5 "
"rad，即 mrad 级位置预算的百分之一），不是测量自身尺度的比值。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:1321 95258444fe45429abe0ea974aa4a0908
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Measured: open loop currents 1.35e-7 of scale and angle step 0.03 park-"
"angle counts; closed loop currents 3.18e-6, angle step **0.14 counts** "
"(one float32 rounding), energy closes to 0.65 %, kinematics 3.2e-9 rad. "
"The self-test perturbs a good trajectory three ways -- a travel 200 urad "
"short, a speed 1 % high, a phase voltage 2 % high -- and requires each "
"audit to go red; all three are caught, so \"this instrument would have "
"found F-40\" is a demonstrated property rather than a claim. A third "
"lesson came free: the energy audit first reported a 38 % imbalance that "
"was **my formula's** -- the dq-side magnetic energy needs the 3/2 of an "
"amplitude-invariant transform, `0.75*(Ld id^2 + Lq iq^2)`. Found by re-"
"deriving on a case whose answer was known, not by loosening the bound. An"
" audit is an experiment too."
msgstr ""
"实测：开环电流为量程的 1.35e-7、角度步长 0.03 个 park 角计数；闭环电流3.18e-6、角度步长 **0.14 个计数** "
"（一次 float32 舍入），能量闭合到 0.65%，运动学 3.2e-9 rad。自检以三种方式扰动一条好轨迹——行程短 200 "
"urad、速度高 1 %、相电压高 2 %——并要求每项审计都变红；三者全被抓住，所以“这台仪器本来会发现 "
"F-40”是一个已被演示的性质，而不是一句主张。第三条教训是白得的：能量审计最初报出 38 % 的不平衡，而那 **是我公式的** ——dq "
"侧磁能需要幅值不变变换的 3/2，即 `0.75*(Ld id^2 + Lq iq^2)` "
"。靠在一个答案已知的用例上重新推导找到了它，不是靠放宽界。审计也是一次实验。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:1330 c39ae8b31ee4418db3878bd0fbae0185
msgid "A-44"
msgstr "A-44"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:1332 fc6a22d169444cbfa8b8bfcec1aeb7e4
msgid ""
"The position row reaches L3, and it reaches it the way the level is "
"supposed to mean: measurement, per-source sensitivity, and a third leg "
"that is an **independent model**. The third leg is two externally "
"published frameworks driven from the command line harness rather than "
"from the suite. ISO 230-2 measures the reversal value the way the "
"standard specifies -- every target approached from both sides -- and the "
"quantisation distribution is measured against Bennett's model."
msgstr ""
"位置那一行达到了 L3，而且是以这一级本该有的含义达到的：测量、逐源灵敏度，以及一条 **独立模型** "
"作为第三条腿。第三条腿是两个外部公开的框架，从命令行台架驱动，而不是从测试套件。ISO 230-2 "
"按标准规定的方式测换向值——每个目标都从两侧逼近——而量化分布则对照 Bennett 的模型测量。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:1337 b807f9cdecba426193e9d3afdc145321
#, python-format
msgid ""
"ISO 230-2, three targets: the reversal value is **exactly twice** the "
"one-sided stiction displacement (ratio 1.00 at 0.6 / 1.0 / 1.4 rad), the "
"same measurement at zero breakaway torque collapses to **0.42 urad** "
"(0.11 % of B, which is the mechanism's own control), repeated identical "
"moves differ by **exactly zero**, and bidirectional accuracy is **0.386 "
"mrad** against the 2.45 mrad budget. Quantisation: a 2 mrad sensor's "
"residual over a sweep spanning one count has sigma **558 urad against "
"q/sqrt(12) = 577 urad, 0.966x**, with mean -51.8 urad inside the q/4 "
"bound."
msgstr ""
"ISO 230-2，三个目标：换向值 **恰好是** 单侧静摩擦位移的 **两倍** （0.6 /1.0/ 1.4 rad 处比值 "
"1.00），起转转矩为零时同一测量塌到 **0.42 urad** （B的0.11 %，这是机制自身的对照），重复的同一次移动相差 "
"**恰好为零** ，而双向精度是 **0.386 mrad** ，对照 2.45 mrad 的预算。量化：2 mrad "
"的传感器在一个计数跨度上扫描，残差 sigma 为 **558 urad，对照 q/sqrt(12) = 577 urad，即0.966 倍** "
"，均值 -51.8 urad 落在 q/4 界内。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:1344 1a2285439e88474c97fcf5bcc76f5532
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Two of the criteria were **tightened after the first measurement**, and "
"the distinction matters enough to write down. P1's band went from +-50 % "
"to +-10 % and the quantisation band to +-25 %: the first because the "
"model predicts *exactly* 2 and 1.00 was measured, so a +-50 % band was a "
"criterion nothing within a factor of 1.5 could contradict; the second "
"because a 16-point sample of a uniform distribution has a ~18 % relative "
"standard error, so tighter would fail on sample luck and looser could not"
" separate uniform from triangular (0.71x). Tightening a band when the "
"model fixes the value is the opposite of fitting a threshold to a run; "
"the tell is that the new band is derived from the model or the sampling "
"statistics, never from the measurement."
msgstr ""
"有两条判据是在 **第一次测量之后收紧的** ，而这个区别值得写下来。P1 的带从+-50 % 收到 +-10 %，量化那条带收到 +-25 "
"%：第一条是因为模型预测的 *恰好* 是 2，而实测 1.00，所以 +-50 % 的带是一条 1.5 "
"倍之内的任何东西都无法反驳的判据；第二条是因为均匀分布的 16 点样本相对标准误约 18 "
"%，再紧就会因样本运气而失败，再松就分不开均匀与三角（0.71 "
"倍）。在模型把值定死时收紧带，与拿一轮运行去拟合阈值正好相反；破绽在于新带是从模型或抽样统计推出来的，从不从测量推出来。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:1351 f6241a593809436a8a328577c8d529ec
msgid ""
"The ISO 230-2 case itself was deleted in A-41 when it could only be "
"measured on a frozen bench, and it comes back now as a **gate** rather "
"than a test case, because its inputs are a scenario sweep rather than a "
"fixture. That is the shape the second half of this entry is about: "
"evidence that lives in a different language from the code it checks does "
"not go stale the way a hand-maintained test does."
msgstr ""
"ISO 230-2 那个用例本身在 A-41 里被删掉，因为当时只能在冻住的台架上测它；现在它作为 **门禁** "
"回来，而不是作为用例，因为它的输入是一次场景扫描，不是一个固定装置。这正是本条后半部分所讲的形状：与被检查代码处于不同语言的证据，不会像手工维护的测试那样腐坏。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:1356 0b1251e5c6e6491e8d3d7d278b613cc6
msgid "A-45"
msgstr "A-45"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:1358 e7cc2ef26c1e4fdc861f0d156a16c422
msgid ""
"The first execution of the new observability discipline (section 3.4 of "
"the maturity plan, enforced by `project/gates.py observability`) asked "
"the question the instrument was supposed to raise: now that any plant "
"scenario can be replayed in float64, which existing claim rows does that "
"re-open? Twelve L2 rows, and **none of them can be promoted** -- the leg "
"the instrument supplies is implementation-level."
msgstr ""
"新的可观测性纪律（成熟度计划第 3.4 节，由 `project/gates.pyobservability` "
"执行）第一次运行，就问出了这台仪器本该提出的问题：既然任何被控对象场景都能在 float64 里重放，那它重新打开了哪些既有的主张行？十二行 "
"L2，而 **没有一行可以升级** ——这台仪器提供的那条腿是实现级的。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:1362 ea2eb976ed4641029a8efa5351682935
msgid ""
"The twelve are registered in `observability.json` with what each still "
"lacks. The number that matters is not the twelve, it is the zero: an "
"instrument that replays the same equations in another language proves the"
" code does what the code says and says nothing about whether the rule is "
"right. Counting that as L3 would make every port an evidence upgrade, "
"which is the cheapest available way to be wrong -- so the gate refuses it"
" outright rather than trusting the judgement of whoever runs it next."
msgstr ""
"这十二行登记在 `observability.json` "
"里，并写明每一行还缺什么。要紧的数字不是十二，而是那个零：一个用另一种语言重放同一组方程的仪器，只证明代码做了代码所说的事，对规则是否正确一言不发。把它算作"
" L3，会让每一次移植都成为一次证据升级，而这是现存最廉价的一种错——所以门禁直接拒绝，而不是指望下一个运行它的人的判断。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:1367 175677d8230e441bbc872f4f7c34e260
msgid ""
"The audit was not free of information: it ranked the remaining work by "
"cost, and the ranking disagrees with the order the plan had. "
"`friction_comp` is the cheapest remaining promotion because the model it "
"needs is already published and validated (Dahl / LuGre / Stribeck "
"describe pre-sliding displacement, which is exactly what a friction "
"compensator claims to undo), while the plan had `speed_from_angle` first "
"on the grounds that the instrument could reach it. Being reachable and "
"being cheap are different things, and only the registry shows both in one"
" place."
msgstr ""
"这次审计并非没有信息：它按代价给剩余工作排了序，而排序与计划里的次序不一致。 `friction_comp` "
"是剩余最便宜的一次升级，因为它需要的模型已经公开并验证过（Dahl / LuGre / Stribeck "
"描述预滑位移，那正是摩擦补偿器声称要抵消的东西），而计划把 `speed_from_angle` "
"排在第一，理由是这台仪器够得到它。够得到与便宜是两件事，而只有登记表把两者放在一处。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:1374 9f83c248e5cb4f8e90d7421f853cac82
msgid "A-46"
msgstr "A-46"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:1376 08283a4a2e6e462dbebd90465ce4e962
msgid ""
"`friction_comp` reaches L3 through the observability discipline, and it "
"is the discipline's own demonstration: O-1 re-opened this row and "
"correctly refused to promote it, because replaying the plant in float64 "
"is an implementation-level leg. What promoted it is O-2, a **model-"
"level** upgrade -- the plant gained a Stribeck dip, the published "
"mechanism a velocity-sign feedforward structurally cannot reach. Until "
"that dip existed, the plant's friction *was* the compensator's "
"assumption, so every check of the compensator was the model checking "
"itself."
msgstr ""
"`friction_comp` 经由可观测性纪律达到 L3，而它本身就是这条纪律的示范：O-1重新打开了这一行，并正确地拒绝升级它，因为在 "
"float64 里重放被控对象是一条实现级的腿。让它升级的是 O-2，一次 **模型级** 的升级——被控对象多了一个Stribeck "
"凹陷，即按速度符号前馈的那种公开机制在结构上够不到的凹陷。在那个凹陷存在之前，被控对象的摩擦 *就是* "
"补偿器的假设，于是对补偿器的每一次检查都是模型在检查自己。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:1381 7bfcfba41c394ef5a520970ec85f6b03
msgid ""
"Three predictions, written first, all hold: cruising at 0.25 / 1 / 2 "
"rad/s with a dip of width 1 rad/s costs an extra following error of "
"**1.8789 / 0.7356 / 0.0364 mrad** against `(Fs-Fc)*exp(-(v/vs)^2)/kKp` = "
"**1.8790 / 0.7358 / 0.0367** (ratios 1.00 / 1.00 / 0.99); the "
"compensation saves `(Fc + b*v)/kKp` measured **2.0500 / 2.2000 / 2.3998**"
" against **2.0500 / 2.2000 / 2.4000**; and the saving is **identical with"
" and without the dip**, to 1e-4 mrad. The last one is the claim: the law "
"has no state, so it is blind to the dip, and the row now states its "
"domain with a formula instead of a caveat."
msgstr ""
"三条先写下的预测全部成立：在 0.25 / 1 / 2 rad/s 上匀速、凹陷宽度 1 rad/s时，多付出的跟随误差为 **1.8789 / "
"0.7356 / 0.0364 mrad** ，对照 `(Fs-Fc)*exp(-(v/vs)^2)/kKp` = **1.8790 / "
"0.7358 / 0.0367** （比值 1.00 / 1.00/0.99）；补偿省下 `(Fc + b*v)/kKp` ，实测 "
"**2.0500 / 2.2000 / 2.3998** ，对照 **2.0500 / 2.2000 / 2.4000** ；而这个节省 "
"**在有凹陷与无凹陷时完全相同** ，到 1e-4 "
"mrad。最后一条才是主张：该定律没有状态，所以对凹陷是盲的，而这一行现在用一条公式而不是一句免责声明来陈述自己的适用域。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:1388 7015b8df4f464e1fae429bbef343b998
msgid ""
"My own P2 was wrong the first time -- written as a flat `Fc/kKp` = 2.000 "
"mrad -- because the plant applies `b*omega` as a term separate from the "
"friction law, so cancelling the viscous share is part of the saving. The "
"measurement said 2.05 / 2.20 / 2.40 and a re-derivation produced `(Fc + "
"b*v)/kKp`, which reproduces all three to four digits. Third time this "
"session that the prediction rather than the code was the thing to fix "
"(A-40, A-42), and the reason the prediction is re-derived and not re-"
"fitted is that a fitted one would have hidden the fact that the viscous "
"term is part of the mechanism."
msgstr ""
"我自己那条 P2 第一次是错的——写成一条定死的 `Fc/kKp` = 2.000 mrad——因为被控对象把 `b*omega` "
"作为一个独立于摩擦定律的项施加，所以抵消黏性那一份也是节省的一部分。测量说 2.05 / 2.20 / 2.40，重新推导给出 `(Fc + "
"b*v)/kKp` "
"，它把三个数复现到四位。这是本轮里第三次要修的是预测而不是代码（A-40、A-42），而预测之所以重新推导而不是重新拟合，是因为拟合出来的那条会把“黏性项属于机制的一部分”这一事实藏起来。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:1395 735a468161ba459e80e9173b3c302ce3
msgid ""
"One bug came with the feature and the suite caught it, which is the only "
"reason it is a paragraph rather than a silent wrong number: the new field"
" was inserted **between** `t_coulomb_nm` and `omega_eps_rad_s`, and "
"`PlantParams` is aggregate-initialised positionally in a dozen places, so"
" every one of them fed `0.05F` to the new field and left the at-rest band"
" at 0. The budget test caught it as a breakaway row moving from 0.213 to "
"0.355 mrad. Appending the field to the end restored bit-for-bit "
"behaviour. **A field's position is part of its API when the struct is "
"initialised positionally**, and nothing in the type system says so."
msgstr ""
"这个特性带来一个 bug，而测试套件抓住了它，这是它成为一段话而不是一个沉默的错数字的唯一原因：新字段被插在 `t_coulomb_nm` 与 "
"`omega_eps_rad_s` **之间** ，而 `PlantParams` 在一打地方按位置做聚合初始化，于是每一处都把 `0.05F` "
"喂给了新字段，把静止带留在 0。预算测试把它当作起转行从 0.213 移到0.355 mrad 抓住了。把字段追加到末尾，行为逐位恢复。 "
"**当结构体按位置初始化时，字段的位置就是它 API 的一部分** ，而类型系统对此一言不发。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:1401 ab17aab38b944e69af4296b01049e495
msgid ""
"The `budget` gate went red on the new setter with exactly the sentence it"
" exists to produce -- \"a new error source arrived and nobody decided "
"anything about it\" -- and the knob is now covered by the friction table,"
" making 11 knobs across 3 tables."
msgstr ""
"`budget` 门禁在这个新 setter "
"上变红，报出的正是它存在所要产出的那句话——“来了一个新的误差源，而没有人对它作出任何决定”——这个旋钮现在被摩擦那张表覆盖，于是 3 张表共 "
"11 个旋钮。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:1405 5952a2bef52f466fa954e398917868f2
msgid "F-42"
msgstr "F-42"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:1407 ca9599d9d08f4612816310bf3e3b895a
msgid ""
"`speed_from_angle.hpp` told its readers that a least-squares slope over "
"the same window would be quieter by `sqrt(12/N)` -- \"a factor of 4.1 at "
"N = 200\". The factor is `sqrt(6N/((N+1)(N+2)))`, which is **5.82** at N "
"= 200. The stated number was wrong by exactly `sqrt(2)`."
msgstr ""
"`speed_from_angle.hpp` 告诉读者：同一窗口上做最小二乘斜率，噪声会小 `sqrt(12/N)` ——“N = 200 时是 "
"4.1 倍”。真实因子是 `sqrt(6N/((N+1)(N+2)))` ，在 N = 200 时是 **5.82** 。原来那个数恰好错了 "
"`sqrt(2)` 。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:1410 4c8051ecb9ba4f5eb24ff24fe93f3957
msgid ""
"Two independent checks, neither of which trusts the other: the exact "
"linear-algebra noise gain (both estimators are linear in the noise, so "
"the norm of the weight row *is* the answer) gives 0.560112 / 0.171916 / "
"0.107937 at N = 16 / 200 / 512, and the closed form gives the same to six"
" digits; the C++ case, run on a synthetic stream, measures 0.3249 / "
"0.1738 against 0.3363 / 0.1719. The `sqrt(12/N)` form predicts 0.4899 / "
"0.2449, which the measurement excludes by 46 % and 30 % -- so the case "
"can tell the two formulas apart, which is the only reason its agreement "
"means anything."
msgstr ""
"两项互不信任的独立检查：精确的线性代数噪声增益（两个估计器对噪声都是线性的，所以权重那一行的范数 *就是* 答案）给出 N = 16 / 200 "
"/ 512 时的0.560112 / 0.171916 / 0.107937，闭式解给出同样的值，吻合六位；C++ 用例在合成数据流上跑，量到 "
"0.3249 / 0.1738，对照 0.3363 / 0.1719。 `sqrt(12/N)` 那种形式预测 0.4899 / "
"0.2449，测量以 46 % 与 30 % 把它排除——所以这个用例能分辨两个公式，这也是它的吻合有任何意义的唯一理由。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:1416 124a554be7184ceca4fbee8362e184f4
msgid ""
"The origin is ordinary and worth naming: the difference carries a "
"`sqrt(2)` of its own, and the ratio was formed as if it did not. The "
"note's *first* formula has the `sqrt(2)` in it; the ratio two sentences "
"later dropped it. Found by deriving both sides rather than by re-reading "
"the prose, which is the same lesson as A-44's: the tool that finds a "
"wrong number is a derivation, not a careful reading."
msgstr ""
"来源很普通，但值得点名：差值自身带一个 `sqrt(2)` ，而那个比值是按它不存在来构造的。笔记里 *第一条* 公式带着 `sqrt(2)` "
"；两句话之后的那个比值把它丢了。靠把两侧都推导一遍找到它，而不是靠重读文字，这与 A-44 的教训相同：找出错数字的工具是推导，不是仔细阅读。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:1421 ca82a3f3d6ed47ee91a3f23dc2635a35
msgid "A-47"
msgstr "A-47"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:1423 71378dd4ffbc4662a3aa0f038125f832
msgid ""
"`speed_from_angle` reaches L3 by the third execution of the observability"
" discipline (O-3), and it is the first one whose leg is **analytic** "
"rather than a second simulator or a new plant mechanism. The claim the "
"row carries is now the closed form checked against the shipped estimator,"
" plus the diagnosis that closes the loop: the row already recorded the "
"rig measuring 6.5x worse than the model, and since the model is verified "
"to 1-2 % when the angle error is independent, that 6.5x is evidence of a "
"*correlated* angle error rather than of a wrong formula. The gap became a"
" measurement instead of a caveat."
msgstr ""
"`speed_from_angle` 经由可观测性纪律的第三次运行（O-3）达到 L3，也是第一次其腿是 **解析** "
"的，而不是第二个仿真器或一个新的被控对象机制。这一行现在承载的主张，是闭式解对照出厂估计器的检验，加上闭合回路的那个诊断：这一行早已记录台架测得比模型差"
" 6.5 倍，而既然角度误差独立时模型已验证到 1-2%，那 6.5 倍就是 *相关* "
"角度误差的证据，不是公式错的证据。缺口变成了一次测量，而不是一句免责声明。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:1429 2db2763dd84c434b995484f23b0879d5
msgid ""
"One prediction did not survive and is recorded rather than deleted: a "
"quantised angle was asserted to give `q/sqrt(12)` at the output and gave "
"**0.616x** of it. The independence assumption behind `q/sqrt(12)` does "
"not hold on a deterministic staircase -- the phase at sample `k` fixes "
"the error at sample `k`, so the two ends of a window are correlated and "
"`Var(diff) = 2*sigma^2*(1-rho)` is strictly below the independent-sample "
"value. What is asserted is that inequality, which is derived; the factor "
"would need phase dithering to measure and is left unmeasured rather than "
"fitted. Same lesson as A-39, one level up: quantisation statistics are a "
"statement about the *phase relationship*, not only about the count."
msgstr ""
"有一条预测没站住，而它被记录而不是被删掉：量化后的角度被断言在输出上给出 `q/sqrt(12)` ，实测是它的 **0.616 倍** 。 "
"`q/sqrt(12)` 背后的独立性假设在确定性阶梯上不成立——第 `k` 个采样处的相位固定了第 `k` "
"个采样的误差，于是一个窗口的两端相关， `Var(diff) = 2*sigma^2*(1-rho)` "
"严格低于独立采样时的值。所断言的是那条不等式，它是推导出来的；那个因子需要相位抖动才能测量，于是留作未测，而不是拟合。与 A-39 "
"同一教训，高一层：量化统计是一句关于 *相位关系* 的话，不只是关于计数的话。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:1436 7e39784454c848819e9f7b22b2523427
msgid ""
"The third thing this pass taught is about self-tests. "
"`observability_gate.py --selftest` had one case that removed a named L2 "
"row from the registry, and promoting that row made the case impossible to"
" trigger -- which the gate reported as MISSED. A self-test pinned to a "
"moving target stops testing anything the day the target moves, and it "
"only announced its own uselessness because it was written to fail rather "
"than to pass when the premise disappeared. The target is now selected "
"from the data."
msgstr ""
"这一轮教的第三件事关乎自检。 `observability_gate.py --selftest` 有一个用例把某个具名的 L2 "
"行从登记表里删掉，而那一行被升级之后，这个用例变得无法触发——门禁把它报成 "
"MISSED。一个钉在活动目标上的自检，在目标移动那天就不再测任何东西；而它之所以还能宣布自己没用了，只是因为它在前提消失时被写成应当失败、而不是应当通过。目标现在从数据里选取。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:1442 cd1a42a4864a4216b9f3104b1d004d63
msgid "F-43"
msgstr "F-43"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:1444 672cf9292bd2485d8b4df90e98cd0c2b
msgid ""
"`ElectronicGear` declared `kMaxStepRad = pi` with a comment saying that "
"the shortest-arc decode assumes the master moves less than half a turn "
"per sample, \"written down because the gear has no other way to tell a "
"fast reversal from a wrap\". The constant had **no consumer**: nothing "
"checked it, and `SpeedFromAngle` already flagged the same condition for "
"the same reason. A documented assumption with a constant and no check "
"reads exactly like a checked assumption."
msgstr ""
"`ElectronicGear` 声明了 `kMaxStepRad = pi` "
"，注释说最短弧解码假设主轴每个采样移动不到半圈，“写下来是因为齿轮没有别的办法把快速换向与绕圈区分开”。这个常数 **没有消费者** "
"：没有东西检查它，而 `SpeedFromAngle` "
"早已为同一个理由标出同一个条件。一个有常数、有文字、却无检查的假设，读起来与一个受过检查的假设完全一样。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:1449 0d201be0d8ff4021b9fa160140916edc
msgid ""
"The comment also names the limit honestly and the limit is the "
"interesting part: with a *wrapped* input a step of half a turn or more "
"cannot be detected at all -- a lost *whole revolution* decodes to a step "
"of zero and is indistinguishable from standing still. What can be checked"
" is the near-boundary case, which is what `SpeedFromAngle` does at "
"`0.9*pi`, and that rule is now here too."
msgstr ""
"注释也诚实地点出了这条极限，而这条极限才是有意思的部分：输入是 *绕圈* 的时候，半圈或更大的步长根本检测不出来——丢掉 *整整一圈* "
"解码成零步长，与静止无法区分。可检的是接近边界的情形， `SpeedFromAngle` 在 `0.9*pi` "
"处做的就是这件事，而那条规则现在也在这里了。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:1453 f5e18ef1ff4941ab9db32433ce98c4a7
msgid ""
"Adding the check exposed a second defect in the same function, caught by "
"the new case rather than by reading: `GearOutput` was aggregate-"
"initialised with `lost_count_` **before** the flag could be set, so the "
"output told the caller nothing for exactly the sample that had tripped "
"it. One line, and it would have been invisible -- the flag would have "
"appeared one sample late, which looks like a one-sample delay rather than"
" a bug."
msgstr ""
"加上这项检查，又在同一个函数里暴露出第二个缺陷，而抓住它的是新用例而不是阅读： `GearOutput` 被聚合初始化时 "
"`lost_count_` 处在那面标志 **能被置起之前** "
"，于是恰好在触发它的那个采样上，输出什么也没告诉调用者。一行代码，而它本来会不可见——标志会晚一个采样出现，看起来像一个采样的时延而不是一个bug。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:1458 3756c932bcfe4bb3be2f7faf34517063
msgid "A-48"
msgstr "A-48"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:1460 5be3110074854d0681c0fc115999b538
msgid ""
"`gear_ratio` reaches L3 through O-4, and this pass is the first where "
"**more than one of my own predictions was wrong before the measurement**:"
" two of four, and both wrong in instructive ways."
msgstr ""
"`gear_ratio` 经由 O-4 达到 L3，而这一轮是第一次 **在测量之前就有不止一条我自己的预测是错的** "
"：四条里错了两条，而且两条错法都有教益。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:1462 a99e83b12f694bb498891657a65d3fdb
msgid ""
"What holds, all derived first: a quantised master costs at most "
"`abs(ratio)*q` and does not grow with time because consecutive deltas "
"telescope -- 1.366 mrad measured against a 2.500 mrad bound, 1.316 of it "
"in the second half of a four-second run, so the bound is exercised and "
"the structure is confirmed rather than assumed; a sample interval off by "
"fraction `j` moves the velocity reference by `ratio*omega*j/(1+j)` "
"(0.95240 of nominal measured against 0.95238); a count the encoder never "
"counted costs exactly one count (2.49958 against 2.50000); and a *sample*"
" that never arrives costs **nothing** (0.00e+00)."
msgstr ""
"成立的部分，全部先推导：量化的主轴至多付出 `abs(ratio)*q` ，且不随时间增长，因为相邻差值会互相抵消——实测 1.366 "
"mrad，对照 2.500 mrad 的界，其中1.316 "
"落在四秒运行的后半段，于是这个界被用到了，结构是被确认的而不是被假设的；采样间隔偏差比例 `j` 时，速度参考移动 "
"`ratio*omega*j/(1+j)` （实测为标称值的 0.95240，对照 "
"0.95238）；编码器从未计过的一个计数恰好代价一个计数（2.49958 对照 2.50000）；而一个从未到达的 *采样* 代价是 **零**"
" （0.00e+00）。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:1469 c75859436ebf4465967f793c7c176162
msgid ""
"The two corrections. (1) P4 first said a dropped *sample* costs a "
"permanent step. It costs zero, because the next sample carries the full "
"accumulated angle and the unwrap recovers it exactly -- the difference "
"between information arriving late and information never existing. The "
"prediction was rewritten around a lost *count*, and the dropped sample is"
" now asserted as the control that makes the lost count meaningful. (2) "
"P3's first form ran at 1 rad/s master, where the per-sample step is "
"6.25e-5 rad and `wrap_pi`'s `fmod(x + pi, 2*pi) - pi` loses about 1e-7 of"
" it per sample -- a **larger** term than the jitter under test. The case "
"now runs at 20 rad/s where the artefact is a hundred times smaller, and "
"the resolution limit is written into the comment instead of being "
"averaged over."
msgstr ""
"两处更正。(1) P4 最初说丢掉一个 *采样* "
"会带来一个永久的台阶。代价是零，因为下一个采样带着完整累积的角度，解绕把它精确还原——这是“信息迟到”与“信息从未存在”之间的差别。预测围绕丢掉的"
" *计数* 重写，而被丢掉的采样现在被断言为那个对照，使丢计数这件事有意义。(2) P3 的第一版在主轴 1 rad/s 下运行，那里每采样步长是"
" 6.25e-5 rad，而 `wrap_pi` 的 `fmod(x + pi, 2*pi) -pi` 每采样吃掉其中约 1e-7—— **比**"
" 待测的抖动 **更大** 的项。用例现在在20 rad/s下运行，那里伪迹小一百倍，而分辨率极限写进了注释，而不是被平均掉。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:1476 2202e1ed458d4a4298402992ab7a8eab
msgid ""
"The unwrap's own numerics were checked against the F-40 failure mode and "
"are sound: a perfect ramp drifts by nothing at 1 rad/s over 40 s (end "
"error 0.000 mrad) and by 0.122 mrad at 20 rad/s, the same at 4 s and at "
"40 s. There is a transient of up to 1.373 mrad at low master speed, which"
" is a measured term this row's 25.6 mrad claim does not separate out; it "
"is recorded here rather than folded into a tolerance."
msgstr ""
"解绕自身的数值行为对照 F-40 那种失效模式查过，是可靠的：完美的斜坡在 1rad/s 下 40 s 内零漂移（终误差 0.000 "
"mrad），在 20 rad/s 下漂 0.122 mrad，4 s 与 40 s 时相同。低主轴速度下有不大于 1.373 mrad "
"的暂态，而这一行25.6 mrad 的主张没有把它单独分出来，它是被量到的项；在此记录，而不是折进一个容差里。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:1481 923a518d8a20443a9277586edb02a561
msgid "F-44"
msgstr "F-44"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:1483 c4c1246e94d64f07afea755ae108e9ce
msgid ""
"`motion_profile.hpp`'s rationale promised \"accel-limited motion with a "
"stopping distance that matches the deceleration it is allowed\", stated "
"as a property of a move. It is a property of the *command*. The axis "
"covers `v^2/(2a)` only if it tracks the command exactly; when the inner "
"loop lags, the axis passes the threshold and keeps going."
msgstr ""
"`motion_profile.hpp` 的论述承诺“加速度受限的运动，其停止距离与它被允许的减速度相匹配”，把它说成一次移动的性质。它是 "
"*指令* 的性质。轴只有在精确跟随指令时才走完 `v^2/(2a)` ；内环一滞后，轴就越过阈值继续走。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:1487 55c044341347408698f8284d09e546d9
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The row was being promoted to L3 and the deficit had to be written down "
"as a number rather than as a caveat: the axis passes the deceleration "
"threshold at **86.3 % of it** (a 27.4 mrad deficit on a 1 rad move). The "
"documentation simply had no place to put that number, which is how it "
"stayed unwritten. This is the same class as F-42 -- a shipped sentence "
"making a quantitative promise without its domain -- and it was found the "
"same way, by deriving what the claim should say instead of re-reading "
"what it does say."
msgstr ""
"这一行正要升到 L3，而缺口必须写成一个数字而不是一句免责声明：轴越过减速阈值时只到它的 **86.3 %** （1 rad 的移动上差 27.4"
" mrad）。文档里根本没有地方放这个数字，它就是这样一直没被写下来。这与 F-42 "
"同一类——一句已交付的话做出定量承诺却不给适用域——而发现它的方式也相同：推导这条主张该说什么，而不是重读它现在说了什么。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:1493 7b3c4e41b4af4987a7b213415a608b9b
msgid ""
"Header prose only. What it changes is that a reader can no longer take "
"`v^2/(2a)` as a bound on a real axis; the L3 claim row carries the "
"measured deficit."
msgstr "只改头文件里的文字。它改变的是：读者不再能把 `v^2/(2a)` 当作真实轴上的一个界；L3 主张行承载实测的缺口。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:1496 1c2d1d8321c047d198f3736d8df923a7
msgid "A-49"
