msgstr ""
"**工作区里的树构建不起来** ，而 `main` 可以： `conan create` 在测试步骤上照着待提交的改动失败（ **599 个用例里"
" 15 个失败** ），于是这棵树从未作为已测试的产物进入缓存。（这一行最初写下的覆盖率数字——91.43 %，对照 94.0%的地板——是 "
"**错的，已撤回** ：它来自对一次失败构建留下的导出目录跑 `coverage_gate.py` ，而不是来自配方自己的测量。配方报的是 "
"94.22 % 全部/95.74 % core，两者都在各自地板之上。见 F-99，那个条目正是因为这次错误才存在。）"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2696 0daa86fe2166410ba0f2e2c0b6e82f21
msgid ""
"Surfaced by running the full build as the last step of A-95 -- the "
"promotion was the reason a green suite mattered, and there was none. The "
"largest cluster is `Protection.*` (13 cases), and it is a real logic "
"failure, not instrumentation: "
"`EveryFaultIsClassifiedAsItselfAndNothingElse` prints \"5\" against "
"`EXPECT_EQ(8, correct)`, i.e. three of eight rows of the fault-"
"classification matrix are wrong. A boolean comparison is build-mode "
"independent, so this fails in every configuration, coverage or not. "
"`c_api_validation` and `python_bindings` fail as well; those two are the "
"reason `src/api/foc_api.c` sits at 77.65 % and `bridge.cpp` at 82.08 %. "
"Not yet diagnosed."
msgstr ""
"它是在 A-95 的最后一步跑完整构建时浮出来的——正是那次提升使绿色的套件变得要紧，而当时并没有。最大的一簇是 `Protection.*` "
"（13 个用例），而且是真的逻辑失败，不是插桩问题： `EveryFaultIsClassifiedAsItselfAndNothingElse`"
" 打印“5”，对照 `EXPECT_EQ(8, correct)` "
"，即故障分类矩阵八行里有三行是错的。布尔比较与构建模式无关，所以它在每种配置下都失败，无论有无覆盖率插桩。 `c_api_validation` "
"与 `python_bindings` 也失败；那两个正是 `src/api/foc_api.c` 停在 77.65 %、 "
"`bridge.cpp` 停在 82.08 % 的原因。尚未诊断。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2703 4e34bb1d795d4d679a6d92ad1ac41c9d
msgid ""
"Blast radius is every claim in README: the suite that is supposed to back"
" them did not pass, and nothing said so. Two lessons came with it. First,"
" **`ctest -N` overwrites `Testing/Temporary/LastTest.log`**: the "
"diagnostic used to read the failure list destroyed the record of what had"
" failed, and the suite had to be re-run to recover it -- a read-only "
"question answered by a write. Second, the failures are all in uncommitted"
" work (`protection.hpp`, `foc_api.c` are both modified against HEAD), "
"which is why no earlier row caught them: nothing had run the suite."
msgstr ""
"影响范围是 README 里的每一条主张：本该支撑它们的套件没有通过，而没有任何东西说出来。随它带来两条教训。第一， **`ctest -N` "
"会覆盖 `Testing/Temporary/LastTest.log`** "
"：用来读取失败清单的诊断毁掉了“什么失败过”的记录，套件只好重跑才把它找回——一个只读的问题被一次写回答。第二，这些失败全在未提交的改动里（ "
"`protection.hpp` 、 `foc_api.c` 都相对 HEAD被改过），这就是更早的行没有抓到它们的原因：没有任何东西跑过套件。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2711 6987539aadb84878a2d6e884ce0204d3
msgid "F-97"
msgstr "F-97"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2713 c64081ac17dc43fcb1fe81b8df2c2db2
msgid ""
"**The thermal budget accumulated `i^2 / dt` instead of `i^2 * dt`, and "
"that line existed only in the working tree.** `q` is an energy in A^2*s, "
"so the increment over one period is `i^2 * dt`; dividing by `dt` made a "
"machine running at its own nameplate spend **180000 A^2*s per 50 us "
"period** against a **4.5 A^2*s** budget, i.e. the protection tripped I2t "
"on the first healthy control period. This is one character and it "
"accounted for **14 of the 15** failing cases in F-96: the 13 "
"`Protection.*` cases and the three `c_api_validation` failures, which "
"assert `FOC_FAULT_NONE` and `output_allowed` on a healthy step."
msgstr ""
"**热预算累加的是 `i^2 / dt` 而不是 `i^2 * dt` ，而那一行只存在于工作树里。** `q` 是以 A^2*s "
"计的能量，所以一个周期上的增量是 `i^2 * dt` ；除以 `dt` 使一台跑在自己铭牌上的机器每个 50 us 周期花掉 **180000 "
"A^2*s** ，而预算是 **4.5 A^2*s** ，也就是说保护在第一个健康的控制周期就跳了 I2t。这是一个字符，它解释了 F-96 里 "
"**15 个失败用例中的 14 个** ：那 13 个 `Protection.*` 用例，以及三个 `c_api_validation` "
"失败——后者断言一个健康步上 `FOC_FAULT_NONE` 与 `output_allowed` 。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2720 b638caca73704d88b11be9a9111cbda9
msgid ""
"Surfaced by running the suite, not by reading the line. The injection "
"matrix printed the diagnosis in one screen: `injected None -> I2t WRONG` "
"(a healthy input producing a fault) and `injected Stall -> I2t WRONG` (a "
"*different* mechanism's code winning the ranking because I2t also "
"tripped). That second row is the instructive one -- the observable "
"symptom was two wrong cells out of eight, but only one mechanism was "
"broken, and the ranking hid it. A chain of ``else if`` checks would have "
"shown \"Stall does not work\"; the independent-flag matrix showed \"I2t "
"fires when nothing is wrong\", which is the actual defect."
msgstr ""
"它靠跑套件浮出来，不是靠读那一行。注入矩阵在一屏里就打印出诊断： `injected None -> I2t WRONG` "
"（一个健康的输入产生了故障）与 `injectedStall -> I2t WRONG` （ *另一个* 机制的代码在排序里胜出，因为 "
"I2t也跳了）。第二行才是有教益的那一行——可见症状是八格里的两格错，而只有一个机制是坏的，排序把它藏住了。一串 ``else if`` "
"检查会显示“Stall 不工作”；独立标志矩阵显示的是“什么都没错时 I2t 也跳”，那才是真正的缺陷。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2727 166ee84a87aa4b62a5a6e7ee7fa22ef8
msgid ""
"**The criterion already existed and was never executed against.** The "
"test's own comment states the equilibrium of this model is `i_cont^2 * "
"tau` = 3^2 * 0.5 = 4.5 A^2*s, and that budget is what the config sets. "
"Only `i^2 * dt` reproduces that identity; the dimensional check is one "
"line. So this row is not a missing test but an unrun one, and the blast "
"radius in a real product is exactly the worst one available: a protection"
" that trips on its rated current protects nothing and stops the machine. "
"**`HEAD` already had `i^2 * dt`.** The division was uncommitted, so the "
"repair was a revert of a regression that no commit ever contained -- and "
"the diff says so unambiguously: after the repair the corrected line shows"
" up as *context*, not as a change, and the only thing the file actually "
"gained was the paragraph of comment above it. The lesson is not \"someone"
" made a typo\" but that **a working tree can be red while `main` is "
"green, and nothing in this repository noticed for as long as nobody ran "
"it** -- which is what F-96 is about. The comment now pins the units and "
"the `i^2 * tau` identity so the next edit in that direction has to argue "
"with the paragraph first. Suite re-run after it: A-98."
msgstr ""
"**判据早已存在，只是从未被执行过。** 测试自己的注释写着这个模型的平衡是 `i_cont^2 * tau` = 3^2 * 0.5 = 4.5"
" A^2*s，而配置设的就是这个预算。只有 `i^2 * dt` "
"能复现那个恒等式；量纲检查只有一行。所以这一行不是缺一个测试，而是一个没跑过的测试，而它在真实产品里的影响范围恰是最坏的那种：按额定电流就跳的保护什么也保护不了，只会把机器停掉。"
" **`HEAD` 里本来就是 `i^2 *dt` 。** 那次除法是未提交的，所以修复是一次回退，回退的是一处没有任何提交包含过的回归——而 "
"diff 说得毫不含糊：修复之后，改对的那一行显示为 *上下文*，不是改动，文件实际得到的唯一东西是它上面那段注释。教训不是“有人打错了字”，而是"
" **工作树可以是红的而 `main` 是绿的，而在没人跑它的这段时间里，这个仓库里没有任何东西注意到** ——这正是 F-96 "
"说的。注释现在把单位与 `i^2* tau` 恒等式钉住，所以下一个朝那个方向的编辑必须先和这一段论理。之后重跑套件：A-98。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2741 a59ea3a49efc493d802b6c02fc73ecc7
msgid "A-98"
msgstr "A-98"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2743 3837a46c3a7b4fba888c5323d76bce41
#, python-format
msgid ""
"**Reverting the uncommitted divide-by-`dt` clears the `Protection` "
"cluster: 16 of 16 cases pass** (previously 13 of them failed), and "
"`c_api_validation`'s three failures were the same mechanism seen through "
"the C ABI -- the fault surfaced in the C API exactly as it did in the C++"
" test, which is what makes a separate C consumer worth having. The last "
"failure was not a defect at all: `python_bindings` was failing because "
"`numpy` was missing from the interpreter CMake selects, so the second "
"half of getting green was `uv pip install --python <that interpreter> "
"numpy`, not a code change. `conan create` now exits **0** with **599 of "
"599 cases passing**, **94.22 % overall** (floor 94.0, margin +0.22) and "
"**95.74 % in core/** (floor 95.6, margin +0.14). README needed no "
"numerical edit for this."
msgstr ""
"**回退那处未提交的除以 `dt` 清掉了 `Protection` 那一簇：16 个用例里 16个通过** （此前其中 13 个失败），而 "
"`c_api_validation` 的三个失败是同一机制透过 C ABI 看到的——故障在 C API 里的表现与在 C++ "
"测试里一模一样，这正是单独一个 C 消费端值得存在的理由。最后一个失败根本不是缺陷： `python_bindings` 之所以失败，是因为 "
"CMake 选中的解释器里缺 `numpy` ，所以变绿的后一半是 `uv pip install --python <that "
"interpreter> numpy` ，不是代码改动。 `conan create` 现在以 **0** 退出， **599 个用例里 599 "
"个通过** ， **总体 94.22 %** （地板 94.0，余量 +0.22）、 **core/ 内 95.74 %** （地板95.6，余量"
" +0.14）。README 为此不需要任何数字上的修改。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2752 389eb19150b9471b8a865df4ca03fcf7
msgid ""
"Honest scope on what this proves. The 15 failures were **one** defect "
"plus **one** environment gap, not fifteen, and finding them required "
"running the suite rather than more evidence. It also cost a retraction: "
"the coverage numbers quoted while the tree was red were measured wrongly "
"(F-99), and the correct method is to read what the recipe prints, not to "
"re-run a gate over a failed build's leftovers."
msgstr ""
"关于它证明了什么，范围要说清。那 15 个失败是 **一个** 缺陷加 **一处** "
"环境缺口，不是十五个，而找到它们靠的是跑套件，不是更多证据。它还带来一次撤回：树是红的时候引用的覆盖率数字量错了（F-99），而正确的方法是读配方打印出来的东西，不是对一次失败构建的残留再跑一遍门禁。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2757 de1362a0783b46d1b2fc3c772e6c4ba7
msgid ""
"The consequence for A-95 is that the reason for holding `torque_map` at "
"L2 has gone away, so the promotion is made in the same turn against a "
"green tree, and `observability.json` O-16 records it as a level change "
"rather than a fresh capability."
msgstr ""
"对 A-95 的后果是：把 `torque_map` 压在 L2 的理由已经消失，于是提升在同一轮里对着一棵绿的树做了， "
"`observability.json` 的 O-16 把它记作一次层级变更，而不是一项新能力。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2762 c629b68bbf6e45ef90fc435b56ebca3d
msgid "F-99"
msgstr "F-99"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2764 c126e1c56f0c4dc2b93d061c3cdf502e
msgid ""
"**I measured coverage by running the gate over another process's half-"
"written intermediate files, and reported the result as a fact for a whole"
" round of work.** The number was **91.4 %**, the real one is **94.22 %**:"
" a 2.8 pp error, larger than the 0.22 pp margin the floor actually has, "
"invented entirely by how the number was obtained."
msgstr ""
"**我是靠对另一个进程写了一半的中间文件跑门禁来量覆盖率的，并把那个结果当成事实报了一整轮工作。** 那个数字是 **91.4 %** ，真实的是"
" **94.22 %** ：差2.8 pp，比地板实际拥有的 0.22 pp 余量还大，而这个差完全由数字的取得方式造出来。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2768 9e5a71f63fa94736b18dea441c6a642e
#, python-format
msgid ""
"A whole hypothesis was built on it and then refuted by evidence: that "
"`c_api_validation` and `python_bindings` do not reach the coverage "
"report, argued from `foc_api.c` and `bridge.cpp` being reported uncovered"
" on functions those consumers demonstrably call. That argument was sound "
"*about the report I was reading* and wrong about the project: after a "
"complete `conan create`, `coverage_gate.py` reads **94.22 % all / 95.74 %"
" core**, and the 109 lines that were \"missing\" are exactly the C and "
"python consumers' contribution, which is merged by the recipe and not by "
"an ad-hoc re-run. The refutation came from re-running the gate "
"immediately after the build finished, against the summary that build had "
"just written."
msgstr ""
"整个假设建在它上面，然后被证据否掉： `c_api_validation` 与 `python_bindings` 没有进入覆盖率报告——依据是 "
"`foc_api.c` 与 `bridge.cpp` 里那些消费端明显会调用的函数被报成未覆盖。那个论证 *关于我当时读的那份报告* "
"是成立的，关于这个项目却是错的：一次完整的 `conan create` 之后， `coverage_gate.py` 读到 **94.22 % "
"全部 / 95.74 % core** ，而那 109 行所谓“缺失”恰恰是 C 与 python "
"消费端的贡献，它由配方合并，不是靠临时重跑合并。否证来自构建刚结束时立刻重跑门禁，对着那次构建刚写下的汇总。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2776 56def963b479413cb8b61dd123754c48
msgid ""
"Blast radius: `docs/verification-numbers.json` and `usage.rst` were "
"written with the wrong figure, and F-96's headline quoted it, so two rows"
" had to be corrected rather than added to. The rule this produces, and it"
" is the same shape as F-89's \"decide from the artefact\": **a "
"measurement tool is only a measurement when it owns the run that produced"
" its input.** Running `coverage_gate.py` on its own, after a build that "
"died before writing a complete export, measures the wreckage. The correct"
" habit is to read the number the recipe printed, or to re-run the gate "
"only after a build that ran to completion -- which is what happened here,"
" and why the retraction is in the same log."
msgstr ""
"影响范围： `docs/verification-numbers.json` 与 `usage.rst` 是按错误的数字写的，F-96 "
"的标题行引用了它，所以有两行需要更正而不是追加。由此得出的规矩与 F-89 那句“按产物判定”同形： "
"**一个测量工具只有在拥有产生其输入的那次运行时才是测量。** 在一次写出完整导出之前就死掉的构建之后单独跑 `coverage_gate.py`"
" ，量到的是残骸。正确习惯是读配方打印出来的数字，或者只在一次跑到完成的构建之后重跑门禁——这里发生的正是后者，撤回写在同一份日志里也是因为这个。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2785 64a6a6b72eb345d18eadb72dd2a09f4d
msgid "F-100"
msgstr "F-100"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2787 da538cda4e5a4aa5a8e13b608d8d3eb7
msgid ""
"**A claim in a shipped header was wider than the behaviour, and nothing "
"could catch it because nothing computed the alternative.** "
"`sinusoid_fit.hpp` said the normal-equation projection is \"unbiased for "
"one [window] that does not [contain whole cycles], which a plain DFT bin "
"would not be\". Measured: a plain rectangular-window bin is **also exact "
"on half cycles** -- 2.50 and 3.50 cycles give **0.0000 %** error -- and "
"is biased only on the other fractions (**+4.09 %** at 3.20 cycles, "
"**+2.01 %** at 3.40). So the sentence was true of 3.2 cycles, false of "
"2.5, and had no test that could tell."
msgstr ""
"**一个随发行版发出的头文件里的主张，比行为更宽，而没有任何东西能抓住它，因为没有任何东西算过那个替代方案。** "
"`sinusoid_fit.hpp` 说法方程投影“对一个不含整数周期的窗口”是无偏的，“而一个普通 DFT bin "
"不会如此”。实测：一个普通的矩形窗 bin 在 **半周期上也是精确的** ——2.50 与 3.50 周期给出 **0.0000 %** "
"误差——只在其余分数上有偏（3.20 周期处 **+4.09 %** ，3.40 处 **+2.01 %** ）。所以那句话对 3.2 "
"周期成立，对 2.5 不成立，而且没有任何测试能够分辨。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2794 32b9eaa223f4414896ee5ec7e6a5d6a4
msgid ""
"Surfaced by writing the L3 cross-check, which is the first time the "
"alternative estimator was actually implemented. That is the general "
"shape: **a comparison stated in prose but never computed is "
"unfalsifiable**, and the log has no way to distinguish it from a "
"comparison that was measured."
msgstr ""
"它靠写 L3 交叉检查浮出来，那是替代估计器第一次被真正实现。这就是那种一般形状： **一句写在散文里、从未被计算过的对照是不可否证的** "
"，而日志没有办法把它与一个真正被测量过的对照区分开。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2797 57abfe5e3a4a499499e43972a4385617
msgid ""
"Blast radius is one sentence, and the conclusion it supports survives: "
"the normal equations are still the right choice, and they are exact at "
"*every* window length tested where the bin is exact at only some. The "
"correction narrows the premise and puts the measured table where the "
"prose used to be, so the next reader can check it without re-deriving the"
" alternative."
msgstr ""
"影响范围是一句话，而它所支撑的结论仍然成立：法方程仍是正确的选择，且在测过的 *每一个* 窗长上都是精确的，而 bin "
"只在其中一部分上精确。更正收窄了前提，并把实测表格放到原先写散文的地方，下一个读者不必重新推导替代方案就能核对它。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2803 02d476c9352f4f2db3cd305bace018d4
msgid "A-101"
msgstr "A-101"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2805 cedf90575bcb409db06c22de6eff4827
#, python-format
msgid ""
"**`sinusoid_fit` promoted L2 to L3 on three measured sensitivities and "
"one cross-check against an estimator that is supposed to differ.** Window"
" length: the fit reads **0.0000 %** (1.2e-7) at 2.00, 2.50, 3.00, 3.20, "
"3.40 and 3.50 cycles while the plain bin reads **4.09 %** and **2.01 %** "
"at the last two of the non-exact ones. Frequency mismatch: 0 %, +-0.5 %, "
"+-1 %, +-2 % and 5 % offsets, each against the analytic envelope "
"`abs(sinc(dw*T/2))`, all **within 1 percentage point** (5 % offset: "
"**5.159 %** measured, 4.687 % predicted). DC offset: **0.0000 %** shift "
"with the constant column, **7.6 %** without it."
msgstr ""
"**`sinusoid_fit` 凭三项实测敏感度与一次对“本该不同”的估计器的交叉检查，从 L2 升到 L3。** 窗长：拟合在 "
"2.00、2.50、3.00、3.20、3.40 与 3.50 周期处读到 **0.0000 %** （1.2e-7），而普通 bin "
"在不精确的那几个里的最后两个上读到 **4.09 %** 与 **2.01 %** 。频率失配：0 %、+-0.5 %、+-1 %、+-2 %与 "
"5% 的偏移，各自对照解析包络 `abs(sinc(dw*T/2))` ，全部 **在 1 个百分点之内** （5 % 偏移：实测 **5.159"
" %** ，预测 4.687 %）。直流偏置：带常数列时位移 **0.0000 %** ，不带时 **7.6 %** 。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2812 4252feee645641139dbba6a7fbe088b0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"**Two of my own guesses were wrong and are recorded rather than quietly "
"replaced.** First, I predicted the amplitude error would grow "
"*monotonically* with the frequency offset; it does not -- +0.5 % gives "
"0.095 % while -0.5 % gives 0.218 %, and +1 % gives less than either, "
"because the error depends on how much of a cycle the mismatch "
"accumulated, not on its size. The criterion was replaced with the "
"envelope, which is a prediction instead of a shape. Second, I predicted "
"the no-DC variant would be off by more than **50 %**; it is off by **7.6 "
"%**, because without a constant column an offset only reaches the "
"amplitude through the basis's non-orthogonality over a non-integer "
"window. The threshold was corrected to the size the mechanism has, not "
"widened until it passed."
msgstr ""
"**我自己的两个猜想是错的，被记录而不是被悄悄替换。** 第一，我预测幅值误差会随频率偏移 *单调* 增大；并非如此——+0.5 % 给出 "
"0.095 %，而 -0.5 % 给出0.218 %，+1 % "
"比两者都小，因为误差取决于失配累计了一个周期的多大一部分，而不是它的大小。判据被换成了包络，那是一个预测而不是一个形状。第二，我预测不带直流的变体会偏出"
" **50 %** 以上；它偏出 **7.6 %** "
"，因为没有常数列时，偏置只能经由基在非整数窗口上的非正交性到达幅值。阈值被改成这个机制实际拥有的量级，而不是被放宽到能通过。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2820 3e122b49dfb74b70aadffc4a993bd29d
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Scope stated in the README row: the sinc envelope is a **bound, not an "
"identity** -- the residual is one-sided at negative offsets and is "
"reported as such. The cross-check leg is a real second estimator and a "
"fair one (it is exact where the fit is exact), which is what makes the "
"4.09 % difference attributable to the window rather than to the "
"comparison."
msgstr ""
"README 那一行里写明了范围：sinc 包络是一个 **界，不是恒等式** "
"——残差在负偏移上是单侧的，并如实这样报告。交叉检查那一支是一个真正的第二估计器，而且是一个公平的（拟合精确之处它也精确），这才使 4.09 % "
"的差别可以归因于窗口，而不是归因于这次比较。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2826 6cff81c4567a43b8a1d4a88db76b8116
msgid "A-102"
msgstr "A-102"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2828 550bda7db79845b7a159eea6b0a8f685
msgid ""
"**`protection` gains both kinds of L3 leg and deliberately stays L2, "
"because the leg O-13 named is a different question and is still open.** "
"Stepping the recurrence and solving the ODE agree to **1e-4**: 1.0555 s "
"against 1.0556 s at 3.2 A, 0.6635 against 0.6634 at 3.5 A, 0.4881 against"
" 0.4881 at 3.8 A. That is a weak test by construction for a *correct* "
"pair -- explicit Euler at a 50 us step over 0.66 s cannot miss by much --"
" so the case also asserts the measurement is **not** confusable with the "
"naive `budget/i^2` (0.367 s), which it misses by more than 40 %. A "
"comparison that cannot tell the right closed form from the wrong one is "
"decoration."
msgstr ""
"**`protection` 拿到了两类 L3 支线，却有意留在 L2，因为 O-13 指名的那条支线是另一个问题，而且仍然开着。** "
"步进递推与求解 ODE 吻合到 **1e-4** ：3.2A 时 1.0555 s 对照 1.0556 s，3.5 A 时 0.6635 对照 "
"0.6634，3.8 A 时0.4881 对照 0.4881。对一对 *正确* 的解来说，这在构造上是个弱测试——50 us步长的显式欧拉在 "
"0.66 s 上跑不出多大偏差——所以这个 case 还断言这次测量 **不能** 与朴素的 `budget/i^2` （0.367 "
"s）混同，它偏出了 40 % 以上。一个分不出正确闭式与错误闭式的对照只是装饰。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2834 9031200d9e894a64b3981225a9501558
#, python-format
msgid ""
"**The sensitivity numbers are the reason this promotion is worth "
"having.** A 10 % current-sense gain error moves the trip instant to "
"**1.1877 s / 0.4672 s** from 0.6635 s -- **+79 % / -30 %**, asymmetric "
"because the budget goes with the square of the current, and both land on "
"the closed form to 0.00 %. A real loop period 10 % away from the one the "
"code was told stretches the trip by **exactly that factor** (0.7298 s and"
" 0.5971 s), which is a prediction the case checks rather than a shape it "
"observes. A 10 K temperature-sensor offset is worth **0.6 A on a 3 A "
"machine** -- 20 % of the current limit, the same order as the current-"
"sense error the project treats as its dominant one, and unlike that one "
"nothing calibrates it unless the caller does."
msgstr ""
"**这些敏感度数字才是这次提升值得的原因。** 电流检测增益错 10 % 把跳闸时刻从 0.6635 s 移到 **1.1877 s / "
"0.4672 s** —— **+79 % / -30 %** ，不对称，因为预算随电流的平方走，而两者落到闭式上都是 0.00 "
"%。实际环路周期与被告知的周期差 10 %，会把跳闸时刻拉伸 **恰好那个因子** （0.7298 s 与0.5971 s），这是这个 case "
"去检验的一个预测，而不是它观察到的一个形状。温度传感器偏10 K 在一台 3 A 机器上值 **0.6 A** ——电流限值的 20 "
"%，与项目当作主导项的电流检测误差同一量级，而且与那一项不同，除非调用方去做，没有任何东西标定它。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2843 e0c008e40a244a48ab0a194ec13532b1
msgid ""
"Two limits are stated rather than glossed. The cross-check compares two "
"solutions of **the same lumped model**, so it validates the "
"discretisation and the closed form against each other and says nothing "
"about whether `i^2*tau` describes a winding -- README's boundary row "
"already says this is not a temperature, and that row did not move. And "
"the derating path is exercised through `derated_limit()` directly, not "
"through a thermal sensor, because there is no sensor model to inject "
"into; the offset is applied to the number the caller would pass in."
msgstr ""
"两处限度被陈述而不是被含糊带过。交叉检查比较的是 **同一个集总模型** 的两个解，所以它让离散化与闭式互相验证，对 `i^2*tau` "
"是否描述得了绕组什么都没说——README 的边界行早已说明这不是温度，而那一行没有移动。而降额那条路径是直接经 "
"`derated_limit()` 走的，不是经一个温度传感器，因为没有可注入的传感器模型；偏移施加在调用方本会传进来的那个数上。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2849 6e3c5a4d9a464002b9305ee22fafb5c2
msgid ""
"**Why the level did not move, recorded because it is the rule working.** "
"The first draft of this row said \"promoted\" and the observability gate "
"refused it: O-13 had already re-opened this header and named the missing "
"leg as *\"a model-level second source for how two simultaneous faults are"
" ranked; the current rank is the enum order, which is a design choice "
"with no independent derivation\"*. The legs added here are about the "
"**trip instant**, not about the ranking, so the named leg is as open as "
"it was -- and promoting on evidence from a neighbouring question is "
"exactly the substitution this repository's levels exist to prevent. The "
"row stays L2, the new evidence is in it, and the missing leg is unchanged"
" and still named."
msgstr ""
"**层级为什么没动，记录下来因为它说明规矩在起作用。** 这一行的初稿写着“已提升”，可观测性门禁拒绝了它：O-13 "
"早已重新打开这个头文件，把缺失的那条支线命名为 "
"*“一个模型层面的第二来源，回答两个同时发生的故障如何排序；当前的排序是枚举顺序，那是一个没有独立推导的设计选择”* 。这里增加的支线说的是 "
"**跳闸时刻** ，不是排序，所以被指名的那条支线仍和原来一样开着——而用相邻问题的证据去提升，恰是这个仓库的层级要防的那种替换。这一行留在 "
"L2，新证据在行里，缺失的支线不变，仍被指名。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2859 efcb89bb1b2f4f2496b7eda2005aae50
msgid "F-103"
msgstr "F-103"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2861 89ae47ed598b4d46bf761b560e6a0b1f
msgid ""
"**The gate that verifies every exit plan was reading an artifact under a "
